In 2018, a French man named Jean-Claude Arnault disrupted the rhythm of the Nobel Prize after being accused of assaulting more than a dozen women.
His wife is an academician of the Swedish Academy of Arts and a judge of the Nobel Prize in Literature.
On the 1st local time, a Swedish court sentenced Arnault to two years in prison.
Arnault, a 71-year-old photographer who is also a powerful figure in Swedish culture, has been accused of assaulting more than a dozen women.
In May this year, the Swedish literary college, which has lost its credibility, announced its decision to cancel the award of the 2018 Nobel Prize in Literature.
The reporter learned from the China Railway Corporation that today the national railway ushered in the peak of passenger flow on the National Day holiday, and it is expected to send 16.19 million passengers and 714 additional passenger trains, including 136 long-distance passenger trains across the Railway Bureau and 578 passenger trains under the supervision of the Railway Bureau.
On September 30, the national railway sent 13.108 million passengers, an increase of 584,000 passengers, an increase of 4.7%, and the national railway transportation was stable and orderly.
Among them, the Shanghai Bureau group company sent 2.56 million passengers, an increase of 202,000, an increase of 8.5%; Guangzhou Bureau group company sent 1.855 million passengers, an increase of 212,000, an increase of 12.9%; Beijing Bureau group company sent 1.283 million passengers, an increase of 20,000 passengers, an increase of 1.6%.
On October 1st, the Guangzhou-Shenzhen-Hong Kong high-speed railway is expected to send 300,000 passengers (55,000 across Hong Kong) and 137 passenger trains (83 pairs across Hong Kong); the Haja Railway is expected to send 28,000 passengers and open 30 passenger trains.
In order to meet the concentrated travel needs of holiday passengers, the railway department scientifically arranges capacity, optimizes station services, and facilitates passenger travel.
Jinan Bureau group company opened the "search Taizhou, water rhyme Yancheng" cultural holiday tourism train; Nanning Bureau group company opened Guangxi Nanning, Guilin to Inner Mongolia Yijina flag, Guizhou Qianjiang, Hubei Yichang Three Gorges and other 7 autumn tourism train; Lanzhou Bureau Group Co., Ltd. added Dunhuang to Subei 7528/7527 passenger train, the end of North Mongolia Autonomous County and Aksai Kazakh Autonomous Prefecture County.
In order to express the blessing of the motherland, the station organizations around the railway celebrate the activities of the motherland.
Zhengzhou Bureau group companies of all major railway stations to carry out "I take a photo with the national flag", "the motherland I praise for you" and other passenger workers interactive theme activities; Wuhan Bureau group company G586 from Wuhan to Beijing on the high-speed rail, the bright five-star red flag will be decorated with joy, train crews and passengers to perform "high-speed rail concert"; Xi'an Bureau group company Mercedes-Benz in Shaanbei Loess Plateau on the D5082 train.
The railway department prompts the majority of passenger friends, during the festive period passenger travel is more concentrated, passengers who have been successfully booked through the Internet and the phone but have not yet picked up tickets, please pick up tickets as far as possible; please carry tickets and valid identity documents that are consistent with ticket information during the ride, and reserve sufficient time to pick up tickets, security checks, tickets, and transfers, so as not to delay the trip.
China's State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi said in a speech before the U.S. Foreign Relations Committee on Friday that at present, China-US relations have once again reached a crossroads, and if the two sides can view each other positively and inclusively, expand and deepen positive cooperation, and properly manage differences and contradictions, they can open up better prospects.
"China-US relations are our common asset, and we need to take care of it together."
He said that he hopes that people of insight from all walks of life in the two countries will take concrete actions to safeguard the healthy and stable development of China-US relations and jointly promote China-US relations to continue in the right direction.
Wang Yi also stressed once again that China will surely walk out of a development path that is different from that of a traditional big country.
This road with Chinese characteristics determines that China will not and will not be able to repeat the mistakes of national strength, and also determines that China will not become the United States, will not challenge the United States, and will not replace the United States.
In his speech entitled "Opportunities or Challenges, Partners or Opponents", Wang Yi said that the deep-seated crux of the current problems is that some American friends believe that China will also dominate, and even challenge and replace the leadership of the United States in the world.
“It’s obviously a major strategic misjudgment.”
He said that this kind of self-imagined suspicion is spreading and magnifying the existing contradictions, giving rise to new doubts and making it more difficult for China and the United States to solve specific problems and encounter more resistance.
Wang Yi pointed out that China is taking a path of peaceful development.
The Chinese have never had the gene for external expansion.
It is believed that all countries can live in harmony and exchange and learn from each other.
Whether in the past, now or in the future, China will neither copy the foreign model nor ask other countries to copy China’s practices.
Earlier, Wang Yi met with former U.S. Secretary of State Henry Kissinger in New York and said that China-U.S. cooperation will win, and confrontation will inevitably lose.
China has always been committed to developing long-term, healthy and stable China-US relations, so as to achieve non-conflict, non-confrontation, mutual respect and win-win cooperation.
The New Office of the State Council of China held a press conference on Tuesday to introduce and interpret the white paper on the facts of China-US economic and trade frictions and China's position.
China's Vice Minister of Commerce Fu Zhou said at the press conference that China is willing to work hard to promote bilateral trade in a more balanced direction, and hopes that the United States can also show a positive posture.
According to foreign media reports, Indonesia's Sulawesi Island was hit by a strong earthquake and tsunami on September 28, and many cities along the coast were severely damaged, and the latest news shows that the number of victims has increased to 1,200.
According to reports, Donggala, a town close to the epicentre, was hit by two rounds of tsunamis, and authorities believe the death toll will continue to rise as the "golden 72 hours" of relief passes.
On September 30, 2018, local time, in Palu, Central Sulawesi Province, Indonesia, rescuers carried an earthquake survivor rescued from the ruins of a restaurant.
Officials in the disaster relief department said that the huge waves caused by the tsunami were as high as 6 meters, and that the impact of the earthquake and tsunami exceeded original estimates.
It is reported that at the time of the earthquake and tsunami, hundreds of people were celebrating the festival on the beach in Palu, and many were swept away by huge waves and lost their lives.
Officials say the tsunami came ashore at a speed of 800 kilometers per hour, and many buildings and infrastructure were destroyed.
He said thousands of houses, hospitals, shopping malls and hotels had collapsed, and mudslides triggered by the tsunami had cut off one of Palu’s main roads.
Sulawesi, a bridge across a coastal river, collapsed.
On September 30, local time, Indonesian President Joko Widodo inspected the city of Sulawesipalu, where the earthquake occurred.
Indonesian President Joko Widodo visited the disaster area on September 30 and said that he had sent troops to assist in search and rescue efforts, calling on the victims to be patient.
Jokot pointed out that due to the shortage of heavy machinery and manpower, it is very difficult to rescue operations.
He learned about the lack of water, food and fuel and other materials in many parts of the affected areas, coupled with the fact that many businesses have been closed after the earthquake.
He called on the victims to be patient and stay in their original position to wait for rescue.
Search and rescue personnel in the city of Palu said they had heard cries for help from a collapsed hotel in the city, but because there was no heavy machinery to remove the rubble, there was no way to do it, and some people needed to save people with their bare hands.
Indonesia's Vice President Kalla said power and communications in some areas had been cut off, resulting in poor information, and that the death toll caused by the earthquake and tsunami could eventually rise to thousands.
On November 5, the reporter Xu Zhiqiang Correspondent Yan Yina learned from the Liaoning Provincial Court's basic execution difficult scheduling meeting that the Liaoning Provincial Court severely cracked down on the refusal to execute in the six-year implementation of the "storm" campaign for a period of six months, transferred a total of 241 people to refuse to commit crimes, and maintained a high-pressure situation to crack down on refusing to commit illegal crimes.
It is understood that according to the unified deployment of the Liaoning High Court, from the beginning of April to the end of September, the Liaoning court carried out a six-month period of basically solving the "storm" campaign, gathering advantageous forces, and launching a comprehensive overall attack on the basic implementation.
At the same time, the courts of the province have organized a number of fines, detained a batch, restricted a number of consumption, punished a batch of dishonesty, and transferred a number of "five batches" to refuse to commit crimes.
At the beginning of the activity, there were more than 132,000 outstanding enforcement cases in courts in the province, and at the end of July, the cases were cleared.
During the activities, the courts of the province fined the executors a total of 120.607 million yuan, detained 4,146 people, restricted the consumption of 162,844 people, 55,128 untrustworthy punishments, and transferred 2,41 people who refused to be convicted.
From January to October this year, Liaoning courts accepted a total of 297,438 enforcement cases, an increase of 13.28% year-on-year; 226,558 cases, an increase of 83.18% year-on-year; and 31.236 billion yuan, an increase of 74.94% year-on-year.
“Where can I take a taxi?
We would like to go to Golden Bauhinia Square to see the National Day flag-raising ceremony!"
Specially from Ningxia by plane to Shenzhen, in Shenzhen transferred to Guangshen-Hong Kong high-speed high-speed rail National Day first bus of the Song couple on the morning of October 1 in Hong Kong's West Kowloon station interview with China News Agency reporters, such as inquiries to reporters.
On the morning of October 1, in order to celebrate the 69th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region held a grand flag-raising ceremony in Golden Bauhinia Square.
According to immigration control station statistics, as of September 30, the number of passengers entering Hong Kong through the West Kowloon Station of the high-speed railway has exceeded 300,000.
Coinciding with the 69th anniversary of the motherland's birthday, the West Kowloon border inspection station is expected, October 1st and 2nd there will be a peak for tourists to visit Hong Kong.
Reporters met at about 7 a.m. on the 1st in the arrival hall, and many mainland tourists took advantage of the National Day Golden Week to take advantage of high-speed rail and travel to Hong Kong.
Mrs. Song, who walked briskly, told reporters that the National Day holiday is a rare holiday of the year, and it has always been her wish to come to Hong Kong's Golden Bauhinia Square to see the flag raising, and she can achieve this wish on the National Day, feeling particularly happy and excited.
However, at present, Ningxia's flights to and from Hong Kong are inconvenient, so in the Hong Kong section of the high-speed rail, Mr. Song inquired about the train schedule and found that the first bus could arrive at 7:30 a.m., connecting the city's transportation to Golden Bauhinia Square, and the time was just right.
He sighed with the reporter: "High-speed rail is too convenient, fast and punctual!"
70 short-distance trains within one hour between Guangzhou South, Shenzhen North and Futian and West Jiulong have greatly facilitated the arrival of residents in the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area.
Mr. Liu, who lives in Shenzhen, arrived in Hong Kong and was preparing to go to the Hong Kong friends who were commuting mountains on the top of Zhonghuan.
Mr. Liu said: â€œIt is a holiday in the mainland and Hong Kong on the National Day, and we plan to challenge ourselves to see if we can walk 50 kilometers of Hong Kong's island path!â€
He explained that if the high-speed rail is not opened, the traffic is convenient and the time is sufficient, and they do not dare to easily try such a long-distance mountain activity.
Mrs. Yang, from Dongguan, came to Hong Kong to participate in piano competitions with her 10-year-old son's high-speed rail, and she proudly told reporters that her son had been studying the piano for 3 years and spent the National Day in this way, feeling very meaningful.
Before coming to Hong Kong, she has been taking the bus, but time-consuming and labor-intensive, she is worried about affecting her son's status, this time through Shenzhen by the high-speed rail, customs clearance is convenient, halving, the trip in the Hong Kong section is even more impressive, she said to reporters: "It seems to take the subway, particularly fast, I did not have time to take pictures!"
At 6:44 on September 23, the G5711 "Harmony" high-speed rail train started from Shenzhen North Railway Station, all the way, and a few minutes later, the train entered the Hong Kong section of the Guangzhou-Shenzhen-Hong Kong high-speed rail, which was the first officially operated high-speed rail train ushered in in the Hong Kong section.
Integrating into the country's 25,000-kilometer high-speed rail network and the Hong Kong section of the high-speed rail that goes directly to 38 long-distance stations across the country also welcomes mainland passengers from different provinces.
Taking advantage of the long holiday from Changsha to Hong Kong to visit relatives Mr. Gao told reporters, before the high-speed rail can only sit to the north of Shenzhen, take the subway through Hong Kong and then turn around the city's means of transportation, change the trouble and time, now directly to the Kowloon Center, go home to eat the child's lunch, feel very happy.
He said, "one place, two inspections" customs clearance procedures more convenient than imagined, "less than 10 minutes, both pass."
The West Kowloon Station, which is adjacent to the airport express line and connects land and air traffic, has also become the first choice for many transit passengers.
Miss Wu from Fujian prepared to travel from Hong Kong to the Philippines for Golden Week, in the West Kowloon point out of the gate she pushed her luggage, unscrupulously told reporters: "I was still afraid not to catch up with the plane, did not expect so fast, more than enough time!"
According to the agreements announced on Monday, the new U.S.-Mexico-Canada trade deal will retain U.S. President Donald Trump’s ability to impose a 25 percent tariff on imported cars, while essentially exempting passenger cars, pickups and auto parts imported from Canada and Mexico from paying tariffs.
If Trump imposes so-called “Chapter 232” tariffs on cars for national security reasons, both Mexico and Canada will have a passenger car quota that is exempt from taxes on 2.6 million vehicles exported to the United States each year.
According to the subsidiary arrangements, pickup trucks produced in both countries will be completely exempted from tariffs.
If Trump imposes auto tariffs, Mexico will get a $108 billion-a-year exemption for auto parts, and Canada will get $32.4 billion.
These two quotas are much higher than the existing level of production between the two countries, providing room for growth for exports from both countries.
WASHINGTON (Reuters) - After several days of debate, Mexico said on Friday, U.S. President Donald Trump’s government and Canada are making concrete efforts to resolve differences in trade predessions that the North American Free Trade Agreement (NAFTA) is expected to remain in place.
Although the lack of details, the obvious progress is enough to prompt the Mexican and U.S. governments to abruptly stop publishing the text of the two-party trade agreement, giving Canada more time to join the agreement.
President-elect Andres Manuel Lopez Obrador told reporters in Mexico that the U.S. government had put forward new counter-proposals to the Canadian government and said he would continue to urge all three countries to participate in NAFTA.
Mexican Economy Minister Ildefonso Guajardo said that the time to submit the text of the U.S.-Mexico trade agreement to Mexico and U.S. legislation has been delayed because Canada and the U.S. government are “very serious” about trying to reach an agreement.
Guajardo said, “Within the next 48 hours, we will know if we have reached a text of a tripartite agreement or whether we will have to publish the text of a two-party agreement.”
Guajardo said his U.S. and Canadian counterparts “specially asked” to delay the release of the text.
A spokesman for the U.S. Trade Representative’s Office (USTR) did not comment on the text of the U.S.-Mexico trade agreement and U.S.-Canada consultations.
Officials from Canada’s prime minister’s and foreign minister’s offices did not respond to requests for comment on counter-recommendations.
According to foreign media reports, in a conservation center on the outskirts of Pretoria, South Africa's capital, two young lions playing together, it is difficult to see anything abnormal, but they are unique.
The University of Pretoria announced: â€œThis is the first cub that has always been born in artificial insemination â€“ the world's first pair.â€
On-campus scientists are working to study the reproductive system of the African Lions.
Ganswinter, director of the Mammals Research Institute at the University of Pretoria, said that the two cubs born on August 25 are quite healthy and normal.
After 18 months of intensive trials, his team finally achieved this breakthrough.
Ganswinter said in an interview with the media: â€œSperm is collected from a healthy lion.â€
Next, the researchers waited for the hormone content in the lioness to reach the right level, artificial insemination for it.
“Fortunately, the results were successful,” Ganswinter said.
He said that the researchers "did several attempts, but unexpectedly, it didn't take too much effort."
He said that the above-mentioned research breakthroughs can be tested repeatedly, and scientists hope to use this technology to salvage the endangered big cats.
According to the International Union for Conservation of Nature (IUCN), lions have become extinct in 26 African countries, and the total number of surviving wild lions has plummeted by 43% in the past 20 years, leaving only about 20,000.
African lions are listed as vulnerable animals by this organization.
"If we don't do something for this animal, they're going to go extinct," Ganswinter said.
He said that this new technology does not have to allow lions to accept breeding, but only to inject sperm into the fertile lioness, just as North America and Europe have done for captive elephants.
South Korea's exports fell in September the most in more than two years, but analysts blamed the decline on fewer working days and said global demand for South Korean goods remained strong despite rising U.S.-U.S. trade tensions.
Indeed, South Korea's average daily exports increased last month.
In addition, preliminary data, released earlier, showed a double-digit increase in exports in the first few weeks of September before the long holiday.
South Korea's year-on-year decline in exports in September was the largest since July 2016, and the decline was larger than the 5.7 percent decline in the forecast of 11 analysts polled by Reuters.
Preliminary values released on Monday showed exports of $50.6 billion in September, down from $51.2 billion in August.
Despite concerns that the intensifying U.S.-China trade dispute could hurt other export-dependent Chinese neighbors, South Korea's exports to China rose 7.8 percent in September, expanding for the 23rd consecutive month.
South Korea's exports to the United States fell 11.8 per cent, as sales of petroleum products fell.
Overseas sales of memory chips and petroleum products rose 28.3 percent and 13.5 percent, respectively, despite concerns that the so-called “super-cycle” of chips may have peaked.
“However, the impact of the trade conflict will be inevitable, because South Korea’s exports rely heavily on the U.S. and Chinese markets.”
Imports fell 2.1 percent to $40.8 billion, nor did they grow 3.1 per cent as estimated in the Reuters poll.
The initial trade surplus in September was $9.7 billion, up from $6.9 billion in August.
According to the Ministry of Industry, thanks to the United States and EU countries, the global manufacturing industry will remain prosperous, which is a favorable factor for South Korea's exports.
The statement pointed out that "the increase in export prices caused by the rise in oil prices will also benefit exports in the second half of this year."
"However, the continuation of the trade conflict between the United States and China, coupled with the intensification of market volatility after the United States raised interest rates, are the negative pressure on exports."
Exports increased to $2.6 billion on an average of $2.6 billion per working day in September, compared to $2.1 billion in August.
South Korea's Mid-Autumn Festival this year falls on September 24-26, so there are only 19.5 working days in September, four days less than the same period last year.
From January to September, South Korea's exports increased by 4.7% compared with the same period last year.
According to the Nikkei/Markit Purchasing Manager’s Index, South Korea’s manufacturing activity rebounded in September, but was supported by domestic orders because of falling orders from China and Japan, which is likely to have a haze over another export outlook.
North Korean media criticized the United States for not easing sanctions against North Korea.
North Korea's "Labor News" issued a signed commentary article on September 30, criticizing the United States for seeking dialogue with the DPRK while not relaxing sanctions against the DPRK, calling it a "contradictory" approach.
According to the article, U.S. Secretary of State Pompeo said on the 14th that "in order to realize the denuclearization of the Korean Peninsula, the key is to implement sanctions against the DPRK", emphasizing that the position of the United States to continue to implement UN sanctions resolutions remains unchanged.
In Singapore's DPRK-US joint statement, the two sides pledged to establish a new DPRK-U.S. relationship that is compatible with the desire of the two peoples to look forward to peace and prosperity.
On the one hand, the United States has stepped up its crackdown on sanctions and demanded dialogue, which is undoubtedly contradictory.
The article said that if it is necessary to establish a new DPRK-US relations, build a permanently consolidated peace system on the Korean Peninsula, and realize the complete denuclearization of the Korean Peninsula, we should put the construction of trust in the first place, starting from what can be done, one by one in stages.
The article also said that the United States should understand that sanctions and suppression will not work against North Korea.
According to the article, even the "North Devinsk" before the "Kazan" made the U.S. military admire it.
"We're going to have a strong potential adversary," National Interest magazine quoted the U.S. Navy as saying: "It's enough to just look at the North Devinsk submarine."
The current commander-in-chief of the U.S. Navy in Europe, Fogo, also praised the North Devinsk submarine.
"This submarine is impressive. If you look at the development of the Russian Navy and how you use the resources, you will know that the main efforts it has made in its research and development have been to strengthen the submarine fleet first," he said.
However, the national interest magazine still believes that the United States maintains an advantage over Russia in this field.
“I believe that Western countries still have asymmetrical advantages,” Fougo said.
Earlier, it was reported that the Russian Navy will install the "Kazan" submarine in 2019.
"Kazan", "Novosibirsk", "Krasnoyarsk", "Arkhangelsk" multi-purpose submarines are "white wax tree-M" variant, displacement of 13,800 tons, diving depth of 520 meters, staffed 64 people, underwater speed of 31 knots, will carry torpedoes, torpedoes and "calibre" and "onyx" cruise missiles.
Beijing News (Reporter Ni Wei) The General Administration of Radio and Television issued the "Notice on Carrying out Special Remediation of Radio and Television Advertising" on September 29, and carried out special rectification of radio and television advertisements from now until the end of this year.
The rectification content includes advertisements with vulgar content, low level and low taste problems, and medical health programs that broadcast problems without record management.
According to the notice, the focus of this special rectification focuses on nine aspects to find and rectification.
Specifically, there are: advertisements that have guiding problems; advertisements with vulgar content, style and low quality problems; advertisements that exceed the time, do not play according to regulations; there are exaggerated and exaggerated false propaganda, misleading the audience, or medical, pharmaceutical, medical equipment, health food, cosmetics, beauty and other issues such as advertising, there are medical health programs that do not have the problem of unrecorded management.
The rectification work will achieve full coverage throughout the country, the rectification and standardization requirements are fully implemented at all levels of radio and television media, the frequency of various channels, various programs and periods, "there are no blind spots, no dead ends, no exceptions."
The notice requires that the radio and television administrative departments at all levels should deal with all kinds of illegal and illegal advertisements found in the supervision and inspection, in strict accordance with the Measures of the General Administration of Radio and Television Broadcasting Institutions.
If the violation is serious, it is necessary to give serious measures such as communicating conversations, notifying criticisms, suspending the broadcast of advertisements until the frequency channel is suspended, and publicly exposed to the public according to the situation.
In recent years, the General Administration of Radio and Television has repeatedly suspended illegal advertisements.
This year, the State Administration of Radio and Television issued a notice to publicly stop the advertising of serious violations such as "0 soaked fruit milk", "sava cocktail", "Bongrit plant anti-breeding" and other serious violations such as exaggerated propaganda and misleading audiences.
The SARFT has formulated a number of laws and regulations and notices to regulate the advertising behavior of radio and television broadcasts.
The "Notice on Further Strengthening the Advertising Management of TV Shopping Shops" stipulates that all video channels are not allowed to broadcast advertisements for TV shopping videos from 18:00 to 24 o'clock every day.
When advertising TV shopping videos at other times, they must not use the host for publicity, they must not use "selling" exaggerated dubbing, tone, action and other publicity, and they must not use publicity such as "Orthomorphism", "Shaped Shape", "fat permeation" or disguised promotion of breast augmentation and weight loss products.
The "Notice on Further Strengthening the Management of Radio and Television Advertising" stipulates that TV stations must strictly abide by the provisions of Decree No. 61 of the General Administration when inserting advertisements in the middle of film and television dramas: non-golden time can be inserted 2 commercial advertisements in each episode (in 45 minutes), each time shall not exceed 1 minute and 30 seconds; the prime time (19:00 to 21:00) each concentration can insert 1 commercial advertisement, no more than 1 minute time;
The notice also stipulates that radio and television broadcasting institutions should strictly review the qualifications and certificates of health information advertisements such as medical care, drugs, medical devices, and health foods, and resolutely prohibit the broadcasting of sex-related advertisements.
In order to regulate the form of health information advertising, you must not publish advertisements in the form of health information special programs.
Health information programs should focus on introducing scientific knowledge such as disease prevention, control and treatment, and must not contain advertising content such as medical treatment, drugs, medical devices, health food, etc., and must not be proved in the name of patients and doctors, pharmacists, and experts.
Manturov said: "We have made adjustments to the format of the MAKS international aerospace salon for the first time. We recommend that China serve as the host country. The Chinese counterparts agreed and accepted our invitation."
Not long ago, Chinese President Xi Jinping attended the 4th Eastern Economic Forum at the invitation of Russian President Vladimir Putin.
This is the first time he has attended the forum.
Ignore the U.S. threat!
The European Union may reach a crude oil procurement agreement with Iran.
The U.S. government recently announced that it will restart a new round of sanctions against Iran in November, and even urged other countries to reduce imports of Iranian oil.
However, America’s allies don’t seem to listen.
According to the New York Times, on the 29th, Iranian Foreign Minister Zarif revealed in an interview that although the United States threatened to impose sanctions on any country doing business with Iran, Tehran was close to reaching an agreement with the European Union on the sale of crude oil.
The core purpose of this agreement is to try to create a new payment mechanism, i.e., to replace U.S. dollar transactions by barter or local currency.
The purpose of this method is to bypass the United States and prevent the United States from hindering financial transfers.
At the same time, although the European Union is committed to promoting the agreement, some French and British officials are also worried that if the agreement is realized, it will be the most open confrontation between the EU and the United States, which opposes the withdrawal of the United States from the Iranian nuclear agreement.
In an one-hour interview, Zarif’s words sounded more optimistic than in recent months.
Because the agreement has the ability to "strip" traditional allies of the United States and effectively break the United States' attempts to reduce Iran's income.
â€œThis ensures that we sell our oil and benefit,â€ Zarif said, according to an agreement reached in 2015, countries have the legitimate right to trade with Iran.
Federica Mogherini, the EU's foreign policy chief, also said recently that "no sovereign country or organization can accept other people's decisions about who they can trade with."
However, she also predicted that U.S. leaders may adopt a series of financial measures to target banks, businessmen and countries that do business with Tehran before the U.S. government imposes next sanctions in November.
In May this year, the U.S. government unilaterally announced its withdrawal from the Iranian nuclear agreement on the grounds that the agreement was flawed, saying that the agreement could not permanently prohibit Iran from producing nuclear fuel.
The U.S. then threatened to ban companies buying Iranian oil and other goods from doing business in the United States.
This threat led to the withdrawal of some companies from Tehran and the collapse of the Iranian currency.
Companies such as Airbus and French oil giant Total have canceled billions of dollars of investment in Iran.
British and French officials have said that the U.S. government is likely to have the upper hand.
Of course, according to a recent report in the Turkish media, the U.S. sanctions don't seem to have had much impact on Iran's oil exports.
Iran's oil minister Zanganey recently revealed that no other countries except South Korea have stopped buying Iranian oil.
Zarif and Iranian President Hassan Rouhani believe that the purpose of a series of U.S. actions is to "tempt" Iran to violate the agreement.
Zarif was also dismissive of a series of verbal attacks by the U.S. side. When asked whether the U.S. would overthrow the current Iranian government with increasing financial pressure, Zarif even laughed, “It’s a strategy of regime change, and that’s the true purpose of the U.S.”
â€�œRevisiting the Fort Remembrance": Xiamen Hulishan Battery Cultural Tourism Market
At that time, Chen Feifei, the first announcer at the Fujian frontline radio station to broadcast the Mandarin in Minnan, came to the fort to remember the history of the fort.
The well-known tourist scenic area and the Xiamen Hulishan Fortress Scenic Spot, which is separated from Jinmen, used to be the place where the Chinese People's People's Liberation Army set up a "front-line broadcasting station".
Coinciding with the 60th anniversary of the establishment of the "frontline radio station", on the 30th, the scenic spot held the "Reorent Battery Memory" activity, inviting several historical witnesses of the front-line radio station, talking about the historical changes of the fort, and witnessing the development and change of cross-strait relations.
At that time, the historical witnesses of the front-line radio station told the history of the battery.
This is one of the second series of "Xiamen Hulishan Fort Culture and Tourism Market" created by Huli Mountain View.
Previously, the first event was successfully held here, creating an exclusive cultural tourism brand activity integrating cultural tourism IP, creative market and traditional folk culture experience.
On the same day, under the guidance of the Xiamen Municipal Tourism Commission, the second cultural tourism market sponsored by Xiamen Hulishan Battery Scenic Area officially kicked off the second cultural tourism market, and in the six-day event, it will take the Mid-Autumn Festival and National Day "happy reunion" as the main tone, so that the people who come for sightseeing and visit can experience the rich Minnan style in "eating", "visiting", "buying" and "entertainment".
"Hearing the sound of the sea" concert has become a big point of view of the fort cultural tourism market.
Wang Yong, director of the Hulishan Battery Management Department, said that in order to commemorate the 60th anniversary of the launch of the People's Liberation People's Liberation People's Liberation People's Liberation People's Liberation Army Hulishan Battery Front Broadcasting Station, the "Revisited Battery Remembrance" event was held, inviting a number of the old broadcasters of that year to talk about the history of the fort, so that people can remember the past.
In addition, this year's tourism market series of activities also includes the 40th anniversary of the reform and opening up choral concert activities, old photo selection activities, 2018 cross-strait "rabbit concubines" large-scale single art installation public welfare exhibition activities and so on.
Among them, "Hearing the Voice of the Sea" concert, as a highlight of the fort cultural tourism market, is an exclusive cultural brand activity created by scenic spots, and invited the Phoenix Flower Women's Choir of the Youth Palace of Xiamen City to help, singing the 40th anniversary chorus concert of reform and opening up at the ancient fort in Yishan, showing the collision of "ancient fort" and the "new era".
Cross-strait "rabbit concubines" large-scale single art installation public welfare exhibition activities, carried out during the National Day in the fortland scenic area, efforts to create an "eyeball effect", attracting a large number of tourists, citizens to visit, take photos, forward the circle of friends, shooting trembling, so that the city of Xiamen to add a "net red" factor.
And "Xiamen · 40 years, you and me and him" - old photo selection activities, in the scenic area to set up the award-winning works exhibition, through a photo with temperature, in-depth exploration of those happy and moving moments.
Fuzhou, September 30 (Reporter Long Min) The sixth meeting of the Standing Committee of the 13th People's Congress of Fujian Province voted to adopt the "Regulations on Promoting the Construction of Ecological Civilization in Fujian Province" on the 30th.
"Green water and green mountains is Jinshan Yinshan" has been written into Fujian provincial legislation for the first time, running through the entire regulations, and has become an operable and executable provision.
Fujian is China's first national ecological civilization test area.
The person in charge of the Legal Affairs Office of the People's Government of Fujian Province said that it is necessary and urgent to form a basic law on the construction of ecological civilization from the whole and overall, so as to solve the problem of regulating the construction of ecological civilization by relying solely on scattered rules and regulations and policy documents, and also to provide a legal basis for formulating relevant regulations, normative documents and measures.
The regulations fully reflect the characteristics of Fujian, the practice of ecological civilization construction mature experience into the form of laws and regulations to promote and implement: such as the Fujian soil and water conservation management work formed by the reproducible, popularizable "Changting experience", the regulations on the Fujian Province water and soil maintenance governance experience summary and upgrading, the provisions of the county level and above local people's governments should strengthen the unified leadership of water and soil conservation work, according to the results of water and soil erosion results should be the implementation of water and soil erosion key prevention areas.
According to the regulations, the system of lifelong accountability for ecological and environmental damage shall be implemented.
Violating the requirements of scientific development and causing serious damage to ecological environment and resources, the main leading cadres and relevant responsible persons with leadership responsibilities are held accountable for life.
According to reports, the "Regulations on the Promotion of the Construction of Ecological Civilization in Fujian Province" will come into effect on November 1 this year.
China and Pakistan agreed to complete the construction of the Economic Corridor in a timely manner and accelerate the construction of Gwadar Port
China's Foreign Ministry said on Sunday that China and Pakistan had agreed to further consolidate and expand economic relations between the two countries.
China and Pakistan issued a joint statement on Sunday to further strengthen their strategic partnerships.
The two sides reaffirmed their commitment to the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor (CPEC) and “oppose negative publicity against the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor.”
Reuters quoted China's Foreign Ministry as saying that China and Pakistan will "strengthen practical cooperation in the field of trade and investment, and enhance Pakistan's industrial capacity by establishing joint ventures in priority areas, transferring labor-intensive industries, and carrying out cooperation among small and medium-sized enterprises."
According to a press release published on the website of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the two sides agreed to complete the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor under construction projects in a timely manner, accelerate the construction of Gwadar port ports and supporting projects, focus on economic and social development, create jobs and improve people's livelihood, and accelerate cooperation in the fields of industry and parks and agriculture.
"The two sides also agreed to complete the second phase of the China-Pakistan free trade agreement negotiations as soon as possible, and continue to promote the negotiation of the China-Pakistan trade agreement on services."
In the joint statement signed on Sunday, the two sides reaffirmed their commitment to the construction of the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor and agreed that the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor is a win-win cooperation plan that will promote regional connectivity and bring prosperity and development to the entire region.
The two sides agreed that Gwadar Port is an important node for cross-regional connectivity and the backbone of the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor.
The two sides agreed to accelerate the construction of Gwadar port ports and supporting projects.
China and Pakistan also said in a joint statement that they oppose negative propaganda against the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor.
The two sides agreed to establish a strategic dialogue between China and Pakistan's foreign ministers and adjust the original strategic dialogue at the level of deputy foreign ministers to diplomatic consultations.
In addition, the two countries will further strengthen defense cooperation and maintain high-level visits between the two militaries and exchanges between various departments and levels.
In order to further encourage foreign investors to invest in China, China's Ministry of Finance and other four ministries and commissions jointly informed that since January 1, 2018, the profits distributed by foreign investors from domestic resident enterprises in China will be used for domestic direct investment to temporarily levy the scope of application of the advance income tax policy, which will be expanded from foreign investment incentive projects to all non-prohibited foreign investment projects and areas.
According to the relevant notice published on the website of the Ministry of Finance, foreign investors must meet several conditions at the same time, including direct investments made by foreign investors in terms of profits, including equity investment behaviors such as capital increase, new construction, and equity acquisition by foreign investors by sharing profits, but does not include adding, transferring or acquiring shares of listed companies (except for qualified strategic investments).
It also includes the profits received by foreign investors, which belongs to the dividends, dividends and other equity investment income formed by dividends and dividends formed by the actual distribution of retained income by resident enterprises in China to investors.
Moreover, the profits used by foreign investors for direct investment are paid in cash, and the relevant funds are directly transferred from the account of the profit-distributing enterprise to the account of the invested enterprise or the equity transferer, and may not be turned around in other accounts at home and abroad before direct investment; the profits used by foreign investors for direct investment are paid in kind, securities and other non-cash forms, and the ownership of related assets is transferred directly from the profit distribution enterprise to the invested enterprise or equity transfer party.
According to the notice, overseas investors actually recover the direct investment that enjoy the temporary non-leviation income tax policy treatment through equity transfer, repurchase, liquidation, etc. Within 7 days after the actual receipt of the corresponding amount, the tax department shall be declared in accordance with the prescribed procedures.
In order to encourage foreign investors to continue to invest and operate in China, the Ministry of Finance and the Ministry of Commerce and other four ministries jointly issued a notice at the end of 2017, since January 1, 2017, for foreign investors to distribute profits from Chinese domestic resident enterprises, directly invest in incentive investment projects, in accordance with the prescribed conditions, the implementation of deferred tax policies, the temporary collection of income tax.
The executive meeting of China's State Council decided last week to further strengthen the protection of intellectual property rights by extending the scope of application of foreign reinvestment from encouraging foreign investment projects to all non-prohibited projects and areas.
The reporter learned from the National Health Commission that compared with a few decades ago, the incidence of malnutrition among children and adolescents in China has decreased, and the incidence of overweight obesity has increased significantly.
In this regard, experts pointed out that to maintain a healthy weight, the most important concept is to "cure the disease", vigorously promote scientific fitness, reasonable diet.
According to the National Health and Health Commission's recently released the "China Youth Health Education Core Information and Interpretation (2018)", the key to maintaining a healthy weight is a reasonable diet and scientific exercise.
Being overweight, obese, and blindly losing weight are not good for health.
The health risks behind the "little fat pier" cannot be ignored.
Ding Gangqiang, director of the Nutrition and Health Institute of the Chinese Center for Disease Control and Prevention, said that overweight obesity endangers the normal growth and development of adolescents, adversely affecting their psychology, behavior, cognition and intelligence, and even leads to high blood pressure, high blood sugar and high blood lipids in children.
At the same time, overweight and obesity in adolescents are easy to continue into adulthood, which will increase the risk of chronic diseases such as high blood pressure and diabetes among adolescents as adults.
Ding Gangqiang said that from 2010 to 2012, Chinese residents' nutrition and health status testing showed that China's 6-17-year-old children and adolescents overweight rate of 9.6%, the obesity rate of 6.4%, the addition of 16%.
At the same time, the overweight and obesity of children and adolescents shows that boys are higher than girls, and cities are higher than rural characteristics, and the rate of overweight obesity has increased significantly in recent decades.
How do teenagers deal with overweight and obesity?
Zhang Li, deputy director of the Scientific Fitness and Health Promotion Research Center of the General Administration of Sports, pointed out that the main reason for obesity in adolescents is excessive caloric intake and insufficient physical activity.
For this simple obesity, we should pay attention to scientific exercise coupled with reasonable dietary control.
Zhang pointed out that to maintain a healthy weight, the most important concept is to "cure the disease", which is a very important part for schools, parents and students to carry out a full range of popular science education, popularize the dangers of overweight and obesity, and improve the awareness of adolescent prevention.
Teenagers should have regular physical examinations, monitor growth and development indicators such as height and weight, early detection, and scientific judgment on whether there is overweight and obesity, so as to take timely interventions.
For adolescents who are already overweight and obese, Ding Gangqiang suggested that in addition to actively scientifically arranging meals and exercises, adolescents are in a special physiological stage, should avoid the use of hunger or semi-hungry therapy to control and lose weight, and should not blindly take weight loss drugs.
Sept 28 (Reuters) - Hackers stole digital landing codes, giving them access to nearly 50 million user accounts, Facebook (FB.O).
Facebook has more than 2.2 billion monthly users, saying it has yet to determine whether the attackers misused any accounts or stolen personal information.
The company also did not find the location of the hackers, and it is not sure if the hackers targeted specific victims.
Initial analysis revealed that this was a large-scale attack.
CEO Mark Zuckerberg called the incident "really serious" during a media conference call.
A spokesperson for the company said that his account, as well as that of Chief Operating Sheryl Sandberg, were also affected.
Shares of Facebook fell 2.6 percent on Friday, dragging down Wall Street's key indexes.
U.S. lawmakers said on Friday that the attack could increase calls for data privacy legislation.
“This is yet another sad piece of evidence that Congress needs to take action to protect the privacy and security of social media users,” Democratic Senator Mark Warner said in a statement.
Rohit Chopra, a member of the Federal Trade Commission (FTC), said on Twitter that I would like to get an answer to Reuters' coverage of the security breach.
Changsha, September 30 (Zheng Yuliang Tiancan) September 30th is China's 5th Martyr's Day.
On such a special day, people from all walks of life, such as the family members of Xiang's anti-war veterans, representatives of members of the People's Revolutionary Party, and representatives of Hunan veteran's homes, came to the "Tang People's Wanshouyuan and Anti-war Theme Park" in Changsha City to participate in the collective burial ceremony of the Xiang National Anti-war veterans on Martyr's Day in 2018, and send 10 anti-war veterans and 4 anti-war veterans.
"The anti-war veterans are the witnesses of China's war of resistance, and they are authentic, vivid and vivid teaching materials for patriotism."
Liu Xiao, the former vice chairman of the Political Consultative Conference of Hunan Province, said that the heroic and fearless spirit of patriotism of anti-war veterans is a precious spiritual wealth for contemporary Chinese people.
Zhu Jianjun, vice chairman of the Changsha Municipal Committee of the Changsha Municipal People's Revolution, pointed out in his speech that in recent years, the "Caring for War Veterans" project has provided caring services for anti-war veterans through living subsidies, free pensions, and free burials, and has become an excellent brand in the social service work of Changsha People's Revolution.
He believes that only if the history is engraved in his heart, he can pass on the spirit of resistance to war.
At 11 a.m., in the solemn and heavy music, the people who came to participate in the event stood up.
The members of the Tang people's ceremonial team were dressed in dresses, holding flowers, and taking neat steps to send farewell to the partners of 10 anti-war veterans and 4 anti-war veterans with neat queues.
The people who participated in the event paid tribute to the anti-war veterans, and there were many children in the crowd, and together with their parents, they paid tribute to the heroes of the anti-war.
"Tang People's Wanshou Park and Anti-Japanese War Theme Park" is the country's first anti-war-themed mausoleum jointly created by Changsha Municipal Party Committee of the People's Revolution and Hunan Tangren Wanshouyuan Co., Ltd., which was completed in 2014.
The first phase of the mausoleum covers an area of more than 2,000 square meters and consists of parts such as "Hero Immortal Monument", "Victory Square" and "Anti-War Hero Cemetery".
"Anti-war hero mausoleum" free of charge for the heroes of the 湘 area to provide behind the cemeteries, praised as "anti-war veteran's last barracks".
Every year before and after Qingming and the National Day, the mausoleum will hold large-scale public ceremonies and burial ceremonies.
Since 2015, there have been seven collective burial ceremonies of anti-war veterans held here, and 102 anti-war veterans and partners have slept here.
The newly revised "Three Gorges-Gezhouba Water Conservancy Hub Navigation Dispatch Regulations" (hereinafter referred to as "dispatching procedures") officially began on October 1, the Three Gorges Ascending aircraft after two years of trial and navigation, officially with the lock unified scheduling.
On the first day of the implementation of the new regulations, the waters of the Three Gorges-Gezhou Dam were in good order.
The Three Gorges Navigation Authority of the Yangtze River issued its first security inspection plan at 21:00 on September 30, and carried out security checks on 160 ships, with a total of 124 ships qualified for security inspection.
At 14:00 on October 1, the navigation department arranged the first floodgate plan after the implementation of the new regulations.
After the implementation of the new regulations, the security inspection plan is issued once a day at 9 o'clock and 21:00, and the damming plan is issued once a day at 14:00 and 20 o'clock, so as to facilitate the ship's flexibility to arrange the daming plan.
The "dispatching regulations" have added the principle of "classification and control" of the ship's dam dispatching principle, according to the function positioning of the lock and the lifting machine to clarify the priorities of the damming ship, and adjust the short-term passenger ship over the lock to the same priority level as the demonstration ship and the integrity ship.
This is also two years after the test operation of the lifting machine, and the official unified dispatch with the locks.
The Sichuan River and the Three Gorges Repository Area large long and wide demonstration ships and new energy power ships also rank first for the first time.
At the same time, the "dispatch regulations" will "navigable dispatch management waters" from the previous 180 kilometers of near dam waters adjusted to Yunyang Yangtze River Bridge to the stone chief river bridge 541.8 kilometers of water, and divided "core waters, near dam waters, controlled waters, dispatching waters".
This is conducive to the choice of suitable waters for locks, and reduces the backlog of ships waiting for locks in the dam area.
According to the characteristics of the current dams and waiting gates, the "Dispatch Regulations" also put forward integrity restrictions such as the cancellation and declaration of ships for violations, and the delay of the dams by 24 hours.
After the Three Gorges water storage, the navigable conditions in the reservoir area have been improved, which has promoted the rapid development of Yangtze River shipping.
According to the data, the annual cargo volume of the Three Gorges locks and Gezhouba locks has increased from 34.3 million tons in 2004 to 138 million tons and 140 million tons respectively in 2017.
In the past two years, the Three Gorges Ascension has passed 5,767 ships, 162,200 passengers, and carried 1,712,800 tons of freight.
Chen Dongyuan, deputy director of the Three Gorges Navigation Authority, said that the dispatching regulations play a positive role in promoting the management of the floodgates of integrity, maintaining the navigation order of the two dam hubs, dredging the pressure on ships in the dam area, and improving navigation capabilities.
"Eleven" small holiday has begun, it is expected that during the day today, there are still gusts of about six or seven in Beijing, and it is still still in the blue warning of high winds.
During the holidays, the sky is beautiful, Beijing is sunny and less cloudy, and there are autumn rains on the night of only 5 days, which is generally suitable for outdoor activities.
However, the temperature difference between day and night is more than 10 °C, and it is better to pay attention to keeping warm in the morning and evening, and beware of catching colds.
Beijing's morning and evening temperature further reduced, yesterday morning, the southern suburbs Observatory minimum temperature has been as low as 7.6 °C, fell below the 10 °C line, the highest temperature during the day climbed to 20.2 °C, the temperature difference between day and night is great, coupled with the north wind blowing, although blowing good weather, but the body is not warm.
This morning, the sky in Beijing was clear and cloudy, and it felt cooler.
"Eleven" small long holiday has begun, the Beijing Municipal Meteorological Observatory is expected to be cloudy during the day today, the north wind is about four, the gust is six or seven, the maximum temperature is 25 °C; at night, the north wind is two or three, and the minimum temperature is 12 °C.
At present, it is still still in the blue warning of high winds, and the public needs to guard against high-altitude falling objects outdoors; the temperature difference between day and night is more than 10 °C, the body feels cold in the morning and evening, and it is necessary to add appropriate clothing when going out.
During the "11th" period, the weather in Beijing is sunny and rainy, cool and comfortable, the whole is suitable for outdoor activities, only autumn rain arrived in Beijing on the night of the 5th, and the public also needs to pay attention to neighboring forecasts.
After the rain, the temperature drops, especially the minimum temperature at night is only about 9 °C.
According to data released by the Beijing Meteorological Service Center yesterday, the average autumn in Beijing is only 51 days.
The longest autumn in Beijing since 2001 was 67 days in 2003; the shortest autumn occurred in 2017, with only 36 days.
Meteorological experts reminded that today's north wind in Beijing is large, gusts are six or seven, and travel should pay attention to the wind.
Dry and dry, should pay attention to diligent rehydration and moisturizing, go out to play but also pay attention to fire safety, beware of fire.
In the morning and evening, you need to add clothes appropriately.
With the approval of Premier Li Keqiang, the State Council recently issued the "Decision on further reducing the catalogue of production license management of industrial products and simplifying the approval process."
The "Decision" proposes to further reduce the production license management catalogue of industrial products, cancel the production license management of 14 types of industrial products, and delegate the management authority for the production license of 4 types of industrial products to the quality and technical supervision departments of the people's governments at the provincial level.
After this reform, the implementation of industrial products production license management products, from last year's 38 categories of pressure to the current 24 categories.
The "Decision" makes it clear that a simplified approval process is implemented for the products in the catalogue.
The first is to change the product inspection before the issuance of certificates organized by the issuing authority to the product inspection pass report issued by the qualified inspection and testing institution submitted by the enterprise at the time of application.
Second, in addition to hazardous chemicals, the provincial people's government quality and technical supervision departments (market supervision and management departments) to implement the license of the products on-site review, enterprises to submit applications and product inspection qualified reports and make a commitment to ensure product quality and safety, after the formal examination can be qualified to receive production licenses, and then within the prescribed time to accept on-site review.
The third is the different types of products in the production and operation catalogue of enterprises, in accordance with the principle of "one enterprise and one certificate", when applying for a new license or applying for a renewal license, a license is reviewed and issued.
The "Decision" requires all regions and relevant departments to solidly promote the reduction catalogue and simplify the approval process.
Increase the commitment of enterprises to publicize and post-site review efforts, strengthen credit supervision and restraint means, implement the main responsibility of enterprise quality, and cancel production licenses for false commitments that do not meet the requirements.
For the cancellation of industrial product production license management products, it is necessary to effectively strengthen post-event supervision, involving public health and safety, environmental protection and other products can be converted into mandatory certifications, make a positive list and publicize to the public, unify the certification standards, reasonable reduction and certification and testing projects, mandatory certification costs are in principle borne by the financial system at all levels.
Take supporting measures to encourage enterprises to carry out voluntary certification, and promote the establishment of brands and the expansion of the market.
It is necessary to benchmark international advanced standards and promote the improvement of industrial product quality.
Give full play to the role of third-party social organizations to ensure the quality and safety of industrial products.
For products that retain the production license management of industrial products, it is necessary to improve the standard system, give full play to the advantages of industry supervision, strengthen the responsibility of "who approves, who supervises", dynamically evaluates product quality and safety risks, reduces the catalogue in a timely manner, decentralizes the approval authority or converts it to certification management.
In September, China's comprehensive PMI increased month-on-month, and the manufacturing PMI fell month-on-month.
According to data released by China's National Bureau of Statistics on the 30th, China's comprehensive PMI output index was 54.1% in September, which is higher than the previous month's and annual averages of 0.3 and 0.1 percentage points, indicating that the overall production and business activities of Chinese enterprises have remained stable.
In the same month, the manufacturing production index and non-manufacturing business activity index, which constituted the composite PMI output index, were 53.0% and 54.9% respectively, down one liter month-on-month.
Among them, China's manufacturing PMI was 50.8%, down 0.5 percentage points month-on-month.
Zhao Qinghe said that this month's manufacturing PMI mainly has five characteristics:
First, the manufacturing fundamentals are generally stable.
Among the 21 industries surveyed, the PMI of 14 industries is in the expansion range, among which manufacturing PMIs such as medicine, special equipment, and electrical machinery and equipment are all located at a higher operating level of more than 53.5%, and the growth rate is faster.
The second is the slight fluctuation of supply and demand.
The production index and the new orders index were 53.0% and 52.0%, down 0.3 and 0.2 percentage points from the previous month, respectively, and supply and demand continued to maintain a state of prosperity, but the expansion slowed down slightly.
The new export orders index and import index were 48.0% and 48.5%, which were lower than 1.4 and 0.6 percentage points in the previous month, respectively, and the prosperity fell to the lowest level during the year.
The fourth is to increase the cost of raw material procurement for enterprises.
The main raw material purchase price index was 59.8%, an increase of 1.1 percentage points over the previous month, and the ex-factory price index was 54.3%, unchanged from the previous month, which was the highest in the year.
Fifth, the operation of large enterprises is stable, and the operating conditions of small enterprises continue to improve.
The PMI of large enterprises was 52.1%, the same as the previous month, since this year, the index has always been in the expansion range of 52.0% and above, and this month's production index and new orders index have increased month-on-month, which is the main driving force for the manufacturing industry to maintain expansion; medium-sized enterprise PMI was 48.7%, down from 1.7 percentage points in the previous month, in the contraction range; small business PMI was 50.4%, up from 0.4 percentage points last month, rising for two consecutive months.
In the same month, China's non-manufacturing business activity index was 54.9%, an increase of 0.7 percentage points over the previous month and rebounded for two consecutive months.
Zhao Qinghe believes that non-manufacturing industries as a whole continue to maintain a steady and good momentum of development.
The business activity index of road transportation, securities, real estate and other industries continues to be below the critical point, and the total business volume has decreased.
Nagoya, Nov 5 (Reuters) - Bank of Japan Governor Haruhida said on Monday it was aware that long-term ultra-loose monetary policy could squeeze the profit margins of financial institutions and could destabilize the country’s banking system.
But he said that in view of low inflation and uncertainty in overseas economies, the Bank of Japan needs to maintain its large-scale stimulus plan while paying close attention to the pros and cons of its policies.
â€œThe Bank of Japan fully recognizes that the strength of financial institutions will be increasingly affected by continued monetary easing,â€ Kuroda said in a speech to business leaders in Nagoya.
He said that if financial institutions are more actively taking risks to make up for the narrowing of profit margins caused by low interest rates for many years, if there is a serious negative impact, the banking system is likely to be volatile.
â€œAlthough these risks are not large at present, the central bank will pay close attention to the development of the situation and encourage financial institutions to take the necessary measures,â€ he said.
Minutes of the Bank of Japan’s meeting, released earlier on Monday, showed that at the September meeting, the Bank of Japan’s Policy Committee discussed the rising costs of long-term easing.
Minutes of the meeting showed that a member said that if the economy continues to expand, "the Bank of Japan will have more flexibility in terms of policy in the future."
According to the minutes of the meeting, another member said that in view of the limitations of the duration of the policy, the committee should discuss how long the Bank of Japan can maintain the stimulus policy.
Kuroda said the BOJ would assess the financial risks posed by accommodative policies, while also taking into account uncertainty surrounding Japan's economic prospects, as U.S.-U.S. trade frictions and rising protectionism could affect global demand.
â€œThe impact of such problems on the Japanese economy is temporarily limited,â€ Kuroda said.
"But how the problem persists, the impact on the Japanese economy is likely to become larger," he added.
â€œThere is a need for sustained and strong monetary easing, while considering positive and negative effects in a balanced manner,â€ Kurada said.
Despite the proliferation of aggressive stimulus programs, such as long-term low interest rates eroding the profits of financial institutions, sluggish inflation has forced the Bank of Japan to maintain the plan.
The Bank of Japan maintained monetary policy last month; in the face of the risks caused by the global trade war dispute, Kuroda ruled out the possibility of raising interest rates in the near future.
On June 1, 2018, Cardiff of the United States, the corporate logo on Tesla electric vehicles.
According to a settlement agreement, U.S. Tesla Motors and its CEO Musk have agreed to each pay a $20 million fine to financial regulators, and Musk will resign as chairman of the company, but will still serve as CEO.
The settlement will put an end to two months of turbulence for Tesla.
The SEC’s disclosure on Saturday of a settlement of the securities fraud charges would take investors a sigh of relief.
Investors had been concerned that a protracted legal battle would only hit the still-lost electric car company further.
The SEC sued Musk for fraud on Thursday, saying its Aug. 7 tweet misled investors.
The tweet said that he is considering taking Tesla private for $420 per share and has secured financing.
According to the SEC, these tweets are actually unfounded, and the market turbulence caused by them harms investors.
Investors and corporate governance experts said the agreement could enhance Tesla, which was hit hard by Musk’s recent behavior.
Steven Heim, head of asset management at Boston Common, said the settlement should put Musk under more oversight while not resorting to “devastating” measures to drive him out of Tesla.
The asset manager owns shares of Tesla’s battery maker Panasonic.
According to the proposed agreement, Tesla will have to appoint an independent chairman, two independent directors, and a board of directors to develop controls on Musk’s external communications.
â€œIt is in the best interests of our markets and our investors, including Tesla shareholders, to resolve the matter quickly and on agreed terms,â€ SEC Chairman Clayton said in a statement.
Thursday's allegations caused Tesla's market value to evaporate about $7 billion, and the company's market value was $45.2 billion on Friday, lower than GM's $47.5 billion.
In the settlement agreement, the SEC withdrew its request to drive Musk away from the company's leader.
Many investors said the penalty would be disastrous.
“I think it’s the best possible outcome for everyone involved,” said Ivan Feinseth of Tigress Financial Partners, who gave Tesla a “neutral” rating and called the SEC’s penalty a “light penalty” for Musk.
â€œIt’s important for Tesla that heâ€TMs still CEO.â€
Neither Musk nor Tesla acknowledged or denied the SEC’s allegations in the settlement, nor did they immediately respond to requests for comment.
The settlement agreement still needs to be approved by the courts.
BEIJING (Reporter Wang Ping) Beijing Morning News reporter recently learned from the Beijing Construction Industry Group that one of the core buildings of the 2019 Beijing World Garden Club Park - Beijing World Garden Club Performing Arts Square project will use a multi-color ETFE puzzle film structure for the first time, and the membrane structure of 5,440 square meters will present six colors: deep red, deep green, orange, blue, red and green.
According to Liu Changbao, project leader of Beijing Construction Wujian Group, the construction area of the Performing Arts Square project is 4,500 square meters, the total amount of steel installed is 1182 tons, and the steel structure roof is supported by the suspension steel trusses of the 26 umbrella arrangement, showing the shape of "butterfly wings" under the Zhang pull of the razing wire.
â€œFrom the air overlooking the performing arts plaza, the colorful roof is like passing flowers and dancing colorful butterflies, and the bright colors will not gradually fade due to the passage of time and the wind and rippiness.â€
Previously, the monochromatic ETFE membrane structure has been widely used in bird nests, water cubes and other projects, but the multi-color puzzle ETFE membrane structure is still the first in the country.
The reporter learned that because there are very few suppliers in the world with a variety of color film structure production capacity, so every inch of membrane structure materials are very "precious".
Liu Changbao said that in order to avoid problems such as overlapping and "fights" at the end of the sore, there will also be an innovative use of the "double fork ear" sorhead structure to ensure that the "fighting" cable head is bundled in the right position through special fixed plug-ins.
At present, the construction of the 2019 Beijing World Garden Park is under way.
Among them, the international pavilion project has completed the hoisting construction of all "flower umbrellas".
It is planned that the project will meet the exhibition conditions at the end of October.
Overseas Chinese around the world celebrate the 69th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China
On the 69th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, overseas Chinese held a variety of celebrations to jointly wish the motherland a better future.
On the evening of the 23rd local time, the Association of Chinese Groups of Australia invited more than 500 compatriots and friendly people to gather in Sydney.
On the one hand, the guests admired the exquisite performances of Chinese artists, and on the other hand, they expressed their love for their homeland.
Wu Changmao, president of the Chinese Association, said that China's rapid progress and development have made China's children overseas proud.
Coinciding with the 200th anniversary of the arrival of the Chinese people in Australia in 2018, overseas Chinese will continue to carry forward the fine traditions of the past 200 years, more actively integrate into the mainstream society, make strong ties of China-Australia friendship, and make unremitting efforts for the economic development and social progress of the two countries.
On the same day, the Botswana China Association for the Promotion of Peaceful Reunification and the Chinese Charitable Foundation, the Botswana Chinese Overseas Chinese Chamber of Commerce and the Gaborone China Assistance Center jointly held the "2018 Overseas Chinese Association" in Gaborone.
At the fraternity meeting, the overseas compatriots each showed their "family skills".
There are affectionate chorusons, singing praises for the motherland's birthday.
Hu Chinese, president of the Botswana Chinese Overseas Chinese Chamber of Commerce and director of the Gaborone China Aid Center, said that while adhering to the traditional virtues of the Chinese nation and realizing the dreams of life, they also contributed to Botswana's prosperity and won the respect of the local people.
He called on overseas Chinese to seize the valuable opportunities provided by the development of the motherland, set sail in the new era, and make new contributions.
Over the past few days, China's foreign institutions have held National Day receptions.
On the evening of the 24th local time, the Chinese Ambassador to Thailand Lv Jian held a reception in Bangkok.
Nearly a thousand people attended in Thai overseas Chinese, Chinese-funded institutions, volunteer teachers, representatives of international students, prominent figures from all walks of life in Thailand, and foreign envoys in Thailand.
At the meeting, the guests tasted Chinese food together, and the atmosphere was warm and friendly.
On the evening of the 26th local time, at the reception of the Chinese Consulate General in Los Angeles, jointly sponsored by the Consulate General and the China News Agency, "Don't forget to forge ahead - China's 40 years of reform and opening up photo exhibition" was held at the same time.
The exhibition captures the historical moments of China's reform and opening-up process from 1978 to 2018, showing the great achievements of reform and opening up and the development of China-US relations.
â€œI’ve been in the U.S. for 38 years, and I’m so excited to see so many wonderful and historic pictures.â€
Zhang Xianghua, an American Chinese entrepreneur and philanthropist, said that the achievements of China's reform and opening up are "really remarkable", and as Chinese, he is sincerely proud.
Liu Yuanji, who works in Los Angeles, said that most of the photos took place before he was born, which he did not understand.
â€œLook down slowly in chronological order, and feel that China is coming step by step, becoming more and more powerful, and we are particularly uplifted in foreign countries,â€ Liu Yuanji said.
Many overseas Chinese, not far away, returned to China to participate in the celebration.
On the evening of the 27th, the 2018 "Cultural China and Global Chinese Concert" played the Beijing National Grand Theatre, and overseas compatriots were invited to perform.
Under the command of Lu Jia, the artistic director of the Italian Chinese people and the National Grand Theatre, the classic tracks have been successively staged, in the familiar melody, under a high level of interpretation, the overseas compatriots are rippling and their hearts are surging.
There are more people walking through the mountains of the motherland.
Since the beginning of September, Zhang Tao, an overseas compatriot from Dubai, has flown 30,000 kilometers in 26 days, from the westernmost to the easternmost part of China, spanning 15 cities in six provinces.
He lamented to the reporter of the China News Agency, "My motherland has a vast territory, a large area, which is one of the brightest pearls on the earth!"
On October 1, Zhang Tao returned to Dubai due to official needs.
Abe plans to let Ganley hold key positions in the Liberal Democratic Party Cabinet reshuffle and so on to meet the end
According to Japan's Kyodo News Agency, Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe has entered the final stage of discussion for the cabinet reshuffle on the 2nd and the adjustment of the party's high-level personnel.
At present, it is being coordinated to let Abe's cronies' former economic regeneration serve as the election countermeasures chairman or chief executive of the party's four key positions.
According to reports, people related to the regime disclosed the above news on the 1st.
In the afternoon, Abe held talks with Yamaguchi, the leader of the Gongming Party.
Yamaguchi called for Ishii from the Gongming Party's land traffic to stay in office.
Abe said "it will be discussed."
Yamaguchi revealed this to the media.
At noon on the 1st, Abe met with the vice president of the Liberal Democratic Party (LDP) at noon on the 1st, and asked "I hope to continue to give help in the future" on the amendment of the Constitution.
Gaocun currently serves as a special adviser on the party's constitutional amendment promotion headquarters.
It is reported that Ganley, as the promoter of "Abenomics", assumed the role of economic regeneration since December 2012, when the second Abe cabinet came to power, but resigned in January 2016 due to a money scandal.
He served as chief of affairs for Abe’s election countermeasures headquarters in the party’s presidential election.
Focusing on the party's four key positions, Abe intends to let second-order Junbo, the chairman of government investigations, continue to serve.
The general chairman, who is responsible for summarizing the discussions within the party related to amending the Constitution, and directing the election of next year's Senate election, has become the focus.
With regard to the cabinet, it has been basically decided to maintain the backbone of the regime such as Deputy Prime Minister and Finance Minister Taro Aso and Chief Cabinet Secretary Yoshihide Suga.
Ishii served for the first time in October 2015 in a cabinet reshuffle for about three years.
On the morning of the 2nd, Abe will decide on high-level personnel at the general meeting of the Liberal Democratic Party.
It is planned that in the afternoon, the list of cabinet ministers will be announced, and then a certification ceremony will be held at the palace.
SHANGHAI, Sept 30 (Reuters) - The China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) on Sunday released the revised Guidelines for the Governance of Listed Companies, focusing on further strengthening constraints on controlling shareholders, actual controllers and their related parties, paying more attention to the protection of small and medium-sized investors and playing the role of small and medium-sized investor protection institutions, while actively learning from international experience to promote institutional investors to participate in corporate governance.
The SFC pointed out that the revised guidelines cover the basic concepts and principles of the governance of listed companies, the composition and operation of the shareholders' meeting, the board of directors, the board of supervisors, the rights and obligations of directors, supervisors and senior managers, the incentive restraint mechanism of listed companies, and the behavioral norms of controlling shareholders and their related parties.
The new guidelines also include the participation of institutional investors and relevant institutions in corporate governance, the basic requirements of listed companies in terms of stakeholders, environmental protection and social responsibility, and information disclosure and transparency.
The revised guidelines require listed companies to implement innovative, coordinated, green, open and shared development concepts in corporate governance, increase party building requirements for listed companies, and strengthen the leading role of listed companies in environmental protection and social responsibility.
Strengthen the role of an audit committee of the board of directors to establish the basic framework for environmental, social responsibility and corporate governance (ESG) information disclosure.
In addition, in response to the concerns of all parties, the new guidelines also put forward new requirements for the stability of control in the governance of listed companies, the performance of independent directors, the high evaluation and incentive constraint mechanism for directors and supervisors of listed companies, and the strengthening of information disclosure.
According to the new guidelines, the CSRC will study and improve relevant regulations and normative documents, guide self-regulatory organizations such as stock exchanges and associations of listed companies to formulate and revise relevant self-regulatory rules, and gradually improve the governance rule system of listed companies.
At the same time, we should strengthen the training of listed companies, strengthen the consciousness of listed companies to improve governance and standardize operation, and continuously improve the quality of listed companies.
Chinese President Xi Jinping said on Monday that China's opening of the door will not be closed will only open more and more, and the pace of promoting a higher level of opening-up will not stop.
Expanding imports is not a matter of rights and interests, it is a long-term consideration for the future, and it is expected that in the next 15 years, China's imports of goods and services will exceed $30 trillion and $10 trillion, respectively.
Xi Jinping delivered the keynote speech at the first China International Import Expo, China will further reduce tariffs, accelerate the development of new formats such as cross-border e-commerce, continue to relax market access, promote the opening up of the service industry, education, health care and other fields in the domestic market gap will relax foreign equity restrictions.
China will protect the legitimate rights and interests of foreign-funded enterprises.
He said that China will pay close attention to the study and put forward Hainan's policy and institutional system for the phased construction of free trade porks in stages, accelerate the process of exploring the construction of free trade ports with Chinese characteristics; add a new area of the Shanghai Free Trade Zone; set up a science and technology board on the Shanghai Stock Exchange, and pilot the registration system to support the regional integration and development of the Yangtze River Delta, and rise to a national strategy.
"China's economy is a sea, not a small pond.
When there is calm, there is also when there is wind and rain," Xi Jinping said. "The wind and rain can turn over small ponds, but they can't overturn the sea.
There have been so many storms, and the sea is still there!
After more than 5,000 years of hardship, China is still there!
Facing the future, China will always be here!"
He pointed out that economic globalization has suffered setbacks, multilateralism and the free trade system have been affected, there are still many factors of instability and uncertainty, and risk challenges have intensified; open cooperation is an important driving force to enhance international economic and trade cooperation.
He stressed once again that China's opening door will not be closed, it will only open more and wider, and the pace of promoting a higher level of opening-up will not stop.
China will stimulate import potential, comply with the trend of domestic consumption upgrading, take more active and effective measures, promote the increase of residents' income, and cultivate high-end consumption growth points.
China will respect international business practices and treat all types of enterprises registered in China equally and on an equal footing.
China will protect the legitimate rights and interests of foreign-funded enterprises, resolutely punish the infringement of the legitimate rights and interests of foreign investors, especially the infringement of intellectual property rights in accordance with the law, improve the quality and efficiency of intellectual property review, introduce a punitive compensation system, and significantly increase the cost of illegal activities.
Referring to China's economic prospects, Xi Jinping said that from the main indicators of economic growth, employment, prices, balance of payments, corporate profits, fiscal revenue, labor productivity, etc., China's economic operation is in a reasonable range, laying an important foundation for the realization of annual goals and tasks.
Compared with other major economies, China's economic growth is still among the highest in the world.
"China's healthy and stable economic development fundamentals have not changed, supporting high-quality development of production factor conditions have not changed, long-term stability to improve the overall momentum has not changed."
Xi Jinping said that for China's economic development prospects, we can be optimistic.
Xi Jinping said that China's macro-control capabilities have been continuously enhanced, with many favorable conditions to maintain long-term healthy and stable economic development, China's economic development has also encountered outstanding contradictions and problems, is taking measures to actively solve, and the results have been and are emerging.
"It is believed that as long as we maintain strategic determination, comprehensively deepen reform and opening up, and solve outstanding contradictions and problems, China's economy will be able to accelerate its transition to a high-quality development track," Xi said.
On November 3rd and 4th, "A CLASSIC TUUR · Classic World Tour" for two consecutive nights in Haikou Wuyuanhe Cultural and Sports Center, 86,000 spectators at the scene to see the "song god" Zhang Xueyou style, Haikou police organized more than 6,600 security forces to carry out the site and the surrounding public security, traffic order maintenance work, for two days, Haikou police arrested a total of "scalpers" a total of "scalpers", the sale of false documents.
During the concert, Haikou City Public Security Bureau mainly led the on-site command and supervision of traffic, public security and other security work, all units, all types of police to participate in the battle of the police to play the excellent style of continuous combat, two consecutive days in advance 4 hours to the post, solidly carry out explosion-proof security inspection, traffic guidance, order maintenance, service to the masses and other security work.
Due to the timely release of traffic travel tips in the early stage, a reasonable division of parking areas, timely guidance of the surrounding roads, 65 minutes in the evening of the concert, only 55 minutes on the evening of the 4th, more than 86,000 spectators and more than 20,000 vehicles left in a safe and orderly manner in the two nights, and good road security and traffic order at the scene and the surrounding roads.
The death toll in Indonesia's earthquake and tsunami has risen to 420, and there have been no reports of casualties among Chinese citizens.
Indonesia's official Antala news agency at midnight on the 29th local time quoted Wilem Rampangilei, the head of the country's disaster relief agency, released the number of deaths from a strong earthquake and tsunami in Indonesia's Central Sulawesi province has risen to 420 people.
The official said that this is still only the statistics of the city of Palu, the capital of Central Sulawesi Province, and does not include Dungala County, where the epicenter is located, and the nearby Sigi area, because communications in these two areas are still interrupted and the number of deaths has not yet been reported.
Due to the severe destruction of many roads in Palu, heavy machinery is difficult to access, and search and rescue efforts have encountered great difficulties.
In order to protect the rescue, Palu Airport, which was closed on the evening of the 28th, suspended all commercial flights after reopening on the evening of the 29th, and the reporter has completed the flight from Jakarta to Palu that night.
After the earthquake and tsunami, the Chinese Embassy in Indonesia understood and verified the situation of Chinese citizens in the affected areas through various channels.
Up to now, there have been no reports of casualties among Chinese citizens.
"The supersonic project is being carried out in accordance with the plans of the international group and the contract signed with the Ministry of Industry and Trade," said Thurpalo, director of Russia's Zhukovsky's Central Aeodynamics Research Institute.
We think it will take two to three years for a technical demonstration and another 10 to 15 years to achieve mass production of civil aircraft.
At present, Russian scientists are facing how to balance the economy and safety of the aircraft.
He said supersonic aircraft are characterized by huge noise effects.
The institute is working with the Moscow Aviation Academy and the Tupolev Design Bureau to develop a full range of civil supersonic aircraft, including business jets and large passenger aircraft for commercial transportation.
General Secretary Xi Jinping delivered a very important speech at the symposium of private enterprises, injecting firm confidence into the private economy towards a broader stage.
General Secretary Xi Jinping stressed that "let entrepreneurs unload the burden of ideas and move forward lightly" has aroused strong resonance among the majority of entrepreneurs and innovative entrepreneurs.
Market vitality comes from people, especially from entrepreneurs, from entrepreneurship.
In the magnificent history of 40 years of reform and opening up, there are thousands of stories of entrepreneurial innovation among thousands of entrepreneurs, and the growth of the entrepreneurial community has continuously promoted China's economic breakthrough.
For some time now, some people in the society have made some negative and skeptical remarks about the private economy.
The so-called "private economic departure theory", "new public-private partnership theory" and other erroneous statements have aroused the doubts and concerns of some entrepreneurs.
Recently, some private enterprises have encountered many difficulties and problems in business development.
For example, changes in the international economic environment have an impact on some export enterprises; the rapid adjustment of the demand structure has brought the pressure of transformation and upgrading; some policies are not coordinated with each other, and the policy effects are superimposed, or the working method is simple, resulting in the opposite effect of some good policies.
Various factors are intertwined, the private economy has encountered difficulties, some private enterprises are facing difficulties in operation, and entrepreneurs have shown a lot of anxiety.
In this context, correcting misunderstandings, unloading the ideological burden of entrepreneurs, so that enterprises are single-minded to seek development, and the government is single-minded to promote development, which is related to market confidence and development expectations, which has particularly profound practical significance.
At this symposium, we once again stressed the important conclusion of the "three unchanged": "The status and role of the non-public economy in China's economic and social development have not changed!"
From the in-depth promotion of decentralization, the establishment of a power list system to create a rule of law environment to protect the legitimate rights and interests of entrepreneurs, to create a fair competition market environment, and to shape the atmosphere in which the whole society respects entrepreneurs, in recent years, the Party Central Committee has paid unprecedented attention to entrepreneurs and the strength of institutional protection.
The symposium clearly put forward policy measures to strongly support the development and growth of private enterprises in six aspects, and launched a series of pragmatic actions dedicated to the "light forward" of private enterprises.
All these have greatly encouraged the group of entrepreneurs and given more expectations to all sectors of society.
The fog is opened, the policy has been determined, and the key is to implement it.
It is necessary to continuously create a better development environment for the private economy, help private enterprises solve difficulties in development, and help realize China's economic transformation and upgrading; let entrepreneurs feel fair in the market competition, feel safe in legal business, feel respected in social life, stimulate innovation vitality and create potential.
When China's economy moves towards high-quality development, it needs more entrepreneurs to exert their ambitions, and also provides more space and stage for entrepreneurs to exert their creativity.
We have reason to believe that with the further deepening of reforms and the removal of obstacles, the private economy will usher in better development prospects and development opportunities and move towards a broader stage.
Inner Mongolia's import and export links all 46 kinds of regulatory certificates to achieve network verification - Sino-Singapore network
Sino-Singapore network Hohhot November 5th (Reporter Li Aiping) Hohhot Customs said on the 5th that from now on, in addition to special circumstances such as the need for confidentiality, all 46 kinds of local import and export control certificates have achieved network verification.
Inner Mongolia enterprises can use paperless methods to declare relevant documents to the customs, avoiding problems such as on-site rushing, paper applications, and repeated submissions in the past.
It is understood that the document preparation time refers to the preparation time of all kinds of documents required for the import and export link before the declaration of customs declaration, which is one of the main factors affecting the overall customs clearance time, in order to compress the customs clearance time and reduce customs clearance costs, it is necessary to reduce the documents.
Previously, there were 86 kinds of regulatory documents requiring customs verification in the import and export links, involving 19 departments.
It is reported that in accordance with the principle of "cancellation can be cancelled, merger can be merged, can withdraw from the port of verification exit port verification" principle, relying on the "single window" platform of international trade, the customs and other 16 issuing authority systems docking and data interconnection, to achieve more data running, less errands for enterprises.
According to the customs side, in the past, enterprises needed to submit paper applications back and forth to the on-site office hall of the relevant departments, and the process was long and unable to track the audit status in real time.
At present, enterprise users can directly log in to the "single window" portal for online applications.
After the approval of the issuing department, the electronic data transmission of the certificate to the customs, and in the customs clearance link to achieve an automatic comparison with the customs declaration data, intelligent verification, the audit results are unified through the "single window" feedback to the enterprise, to achieve the supervision document declaration, audit, customs clearance and feedback of the whole process of online processing.
The export of Korean chicken soup to China has soared by 20 times in 4 years, or it is related to the increase in the number of empty nest youth.
The export of Korean chicken soup to China has soared 20 times in four years Analysis: related to the increase in the number of empty nest youth
Yonhap News Agency reported on the 5th that that South Korea's chicken soup exports to China last year exceeded 100,000 US dollars, up about 20 times more than four years ago in 2013.
According to the analysis, this increase is related to the increase in China's emptiness youth to promote the popularity of convenience food, as well as young people's attention to nutritious meals.
The data was released by the Korean Agricultural and Aquatic Food Circulation Corporation (aT) on the 5th.
Last year, South Korea's chicken soup exports to China amounted to 10.03.39 million U.S. dollars, weighing 21.859 million kilograms, an increase of 2094% and 3668.8% respectively compared with 2013.
According to the analysis, the increase in sales of chicken soup in South Korea in China is related to the increase in the increase in the popularity of convenient food sales and the improvement of young people's attention to nutritious meals.
As of this year, one-person households in China have exceeded the 200 million mark and is expected to increase to 30% of the total population in 2020, and local food companies have also aimed at the launch of all kinds of convenient food for the "single food family".
In addition, the analysis also said that avian influenza is the biggest factor hindering chicken soup to take root in the Chinese mainland market.
aT said that from November 2016 to April last year, there was an outbreak of avian influenza in South Korea, and the relevant departments completely banned the export of chicken soup to China, resulting in a sharp decline in exports.
Exports of chicken soup to China reached 840,000 U.S. dollars in 2016, and exports plummeted to $100,000 last year due to avian influenza.
The first Anhui listed company high-quality development forum and Anhui listed company report conference was held in Hefei City on the 30th.
Deng Xiangyang, standing deputy governor of the Anhui Provincial Party Committee, said that this forum aims to build a comprehensive communication platform for cross-border integration and industrial integration, which has great practical significance to promote the healthy growth of Anhui listed companies, promote the construction of the capital market, and build an innovative and modern industrial system.
Anhui will further strengthen the company's listed reserve resources, promote the organic combination of Anhui's leading industries, emerging industries and capital markets, actively cultivate listed resources, and play the role of listed companies in leading industrial upgrading and cultivating new drivers of economic development.
Chen Xiang said that to promote the economic transformation and upgrading of Anhui and achieve high-quality development, there is an urgent need for Anhui listed companies to improve quality and efficiency and play a leading role.
It is hoped that with this forum as the starting point, we will build a co-construction, sharing and sharing platform for the integration of "political, industrial and academic research", and form a strategic alliance around listed companies and an "investment + investment bank" capital ecosystem.
Hefei, the capital of the province, is definitely ahead of other cities in the province with the number of 45 listed companies.
In terms of industry distribution, Anhui listed companies cover 13 industry categories, nearly 70% are concentrated in the manufacturing industry, and the proportion of listed companies in strategic emerging industries and high-tech industries is low.
South America's largest anime festival is held in Lima, the capital of Peru.
The event, organized by local anime fans in Peru for four days, is expected to reach 100,000 visitors.
According to Japan's NHK TV reported on November 5th, the animation festival has a variety of content, including the American anime character display, the popular Japanese anime "Seven Dragon Ballast" of the Spanish voice actor's talk show, the Japanese anime theme song karaoke contest, anime role-playing competition, etc.
The climax of the venue, the excitement is extraordinary.
In the anime role-playing competition, some children dressed up the characters of the adult Japanese anime and recreated the scene when these characters debuted, and the wonderful performance won the enthusiastic applause of the audience.
Peru's cable TV channels and so on from 2 years ago began to broadcast Japanese anime works, which makes more and more local people like Japanese anime, some couples even give their newborn babies the name of anime characters, the huge impact of Japanese anime culture can be seen.
Rehabilitation arrangements damaged by the wind and breezes at the gates of the Chinese and Portuguese middle school
Recently, some members of the public have paid attention to the repair arrangements that were damaged by the "mangosteen" attack on some of the facilities at the entrance of the Chinese and Portuguese middle school under the Bureau, and the Bureau has been paying close attention to and following up.
After the "Mangzhu" attack, the school has immediately contacted and arranged an engineering and maintenance company for follow-up.
After inspection by engineering personnel, it was determined that the damaged part of the door was still stable and did not affect the use of the entrance and exit.
In order to repair the damaged part as soon as possible, the school has immediately launched the revision process of the maintenance project, and the repair project will be carried out in order during the week.
At the same time, the school has arranged for an emergency engineering maintenance company to carry out the necessary temporary measures on campus to ensure the safety of the campus environment.
On September 29th, the "2018 Philippines First HSK Study Abroad Employment Exhibition" was opened at Guangqi School in Manila, the capital of the Philippines. Tsinghua University and 13 other well-known Chinese universities jointly enrolled in the Philippines for the first time.
"The first HSK study abroad employment exhibition in the Philippines in 2018" opened on the 29th in the capital of the Philippines in Manila Guangqi School, Tsinghua University and other 13 famous Chinese universities jointly enrolled in the Philippines for the first time, seven Chinese-funded enterprises in the Philippines such as China Electric Power Construction, China International Airlines and other on-site recruitment staff in the Philippines.
Cai Art, vice chairman of the Philippine Chinese Education Center, said that since its establishment in 1994, the Philippine Chinese Education Center has hosted a total of 29 Chinese language proficiency exams and 4 Chinese level speaking exams, with a total of 47,000 people participating in the exam.
In order to enable the majority of Chinese learners in the Philippines to learn and learn to be useful, this year, under the guidance of the Confucius Institute headquarters / the National Han Dynasty Hanka International, held the first HSK study abroad employment exhibition.
The first HSK study abroad employment exhibition in the Philippines is a hot spot for Chinese colleges and universities.
Liu Xiaolong, manager of the Confucius Institute Headquarters/National Hanban Hankao International Examination Department, said that in 2017, the number of people participating in the HSK exam in the Philippines exceeded 25,000, and the Philippines has become one of the countries with the largest number of HSK test takers.
Holding the study abroad employment exhibition, I hope that Filipino Chinese learners will have the opportunity to have face-to-face exchanges with Chinese first-class university teachers, and at the same time expand the overseas sources of famous Chinese universities; invited Chinese-funded enterprises in the Philippines to participate in the exhibition, hoping to provide graduate employment options for international students in China.
TOLENTINO AQUINO, deputy director of the Philippine Capital Education Bureau, said in his speech that public schools in the Manila area have opened more Chinese courses, and as the Philippines-China relationship has entered the best period in history, Chinese has become a very useful skill, and China's well-known colleges and universities will promote educational cooperation between the two countries.
Those who participated in the Chinese language proficiency test on the same day were 1,304 candidates from ten schools in the Greater Manila area and 25 candidates from the community, who applied for the HSK 2 to 6 exams respectively.
Mr. Liu Yuting of Tsinghua University Admissions Office told the China News Agency that many Filipino students are prepared to show interest in Tsinghua economic management, computer and medical majors.
He introduced that HSK students who have reached more than five levels can visit the school's official website.
The China News Agency reporter saw at the booth of Southwest University of Finance and Economics that 14 students had left the intention of applying for the examination at less than ten o'clock.
According to Mr. Bai Qiaoyan, who is responsible for enrollment, the school has six types of scholarships for overseas students, among which the highest Chinese national government scholarships (Ph.D.) are free of tuition fees, accommodation is provided, and there are 3,500 yuan per month.
Qin Shanghai, dean of the School of International Education of China Ocean University, told reporters that marine science, marine life, marine geology, aquaculture, and the use of marine living resources are the characteristic disciplines of the school.
China has a long coastline, the Philippines is the land of the island, and marine scientific research is in demand and complementary.
According to Tongji University's International Student Office, Tongji University has several majors in the world's top rankings, including civil engineering, marine, management and other majors and the needs of the Philippines.
At present, there are four Filipino students studying at this school.
On-site recruitment of Chinese-funded enterprises are well-known enterprises that have been cultivated for many years.
On the same day, Southern Airlines received three resumes.
The positions recruited by the representative office of China Power Construction Philippines include company clerks, on-site management of power plants, and power plant construction engineers.
"It is hoped that Filipino students will go to China to study in a targeted manner, such as learning China's welding technology and coming back to participate in the country's 'Great Construction Special Construction' program, the employment opportunities will be very good," said Zhao Changjie of the representative office.
U.S. warships approach China's South China Sea islands again
U.S. officials revealed on Sunday (September 30, 2018) that the U.S. Navy destroyer USS Decatur sailed into the waters near the islands of the South China Sea, which Beijing claims on the eve of China's 11th National Day.
U.S. U.S. officials, who asked to remain anonymous, said U.S. destroyer USS Decatur sailed within 12 nautical miles of Gaven Reef and Johnson Reef in the Spratly Islands.
The official said that the U.S. will continue to do so in the future, as it has done in the past.
U.S. President Donald Trump has accused Beijing of trying to interfere in U.S. congressional elections and has entered a new phase of pressuring Beijing on Washington’s behalf.
Earlier, in May of this year, the U.S. Navy also had two warships entering the waters near islands in the South China Sea that China claims.
Comments from Washington believe the move could infuriate China at a time of U.S.-China tensions.
WASHINGTON (Reuters) - U.S. sanctions on Iran’s oil and financial sectors resumed on Monday, increasing pressure on Iran to limit Iran’s missile and nuclear programs and curb Iran’s growing military and political influence in the Middle East.
Such a move would restore U.S. sanctions lifted under the 2015 Iran nuclear deal, with 300 new targets for Iran’s oil, shipping, insurance and banking sectors.
Details of the sanctions will be announced at a press conference at 1330GMT by Secretary of State Mike Pompeo and Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin.
The U.S. said it would temporarily allow eight importers to continue buying Iranian oil, including major buyers of Iranian oil such as China, India, South Korea, Japan and Turkey, to ensure that crude prices remain stable.
U.S. officials have said the countries will put the money paid to Iran in an escrow account.
A few days ago, the General Office of the Ministry of Education issued the "Notice on the progress of the rectification of special governance actions of off-campus training institutions nationwide", as of October 15, 2018, there were 400,532 off-campus training institutions in the country, 272,175 institutions with problems, which have now completed 83,510 rectifications, and the rectification rate was 30.68%.
There are 6,611 institutions that have found problems in Heilongjiang Province, 2,178 have been rectified, and the rectification rate has reached 32.95%.
It is reported that that the special governance work of China's off-campus training institutions has entered a comprehensive rectification stage, according to the spirit of the "Opinions on Regulating the Development of Out-of-School Training Institutions" issued by the General Office of the State Council, in order to effectively do a good job in the special governance rectification work of off-campus training institutions to ensure the completion of rectification tasks by the end of the year, the provincial education administrative departments have accelerated rectification in accordance with the criteria, the county-level education administrative departments in accordance with the preliminary investigation and preliminary rectification.
In line with the setting standards or after the rectification and acceptance qualified into the white list, and timely publicity to the public.
In order to prevent misleading parents and students, to eliminate advanced excessive training and false propaganda, should be based on the principles of simplicity, intuition, accuracy, norms, according to the student's grade and training disciplines, naming the name of the subject training courses, training institutions as soon as possible the name of the training courses, training content, enrollment objects, scheduling, class hours, etc. reported to the county-level education department for record review, county-level education departments should be completed in a timely manner.
Classes that have not passed the record review are not allowed to enroll in training.
Teachers who strictly grasp the qualifications of teachers engaged in language, mathematics, English and physics, chemistry, chemistry, biology and other disciplines should have corresponding teacher qualifications.
Fujian Provincial flood control office reported on the 30th, in view of this year's No. 24 Typhoon "Tan Mei" on Fujian coastal and marine areas basically ended, according to the "Fujian Province flood control typhoon emergency plan", at 10 o'clock on the 30th to terminate the typhoon emergency response, all relevant areas can restore normal production and living order in due course.
Typhoon "Tan Mei" began to turn at noon on the 29th, moving along the northeast direction, gradually moving away from Fujian Province, at 8 o'clock on the 30th typhoon center is located about 140 kilometers to the east of Kagoshima, Japan.
As a result, the Fujian Provincial Meteorological Observatory lifted the "sea wind warning level III" at 8 o'clock on the 30th.
Previously, in order to prevent Typhoon "Tan Mei", as of 11:00 on the 28th statistics, Fujian has evacuated 268 fishing boats, the transfer of fishing rows of old and weak women and children 22,82 people.
China-Vietnamese border estuary port held a flag-raising ceremony to celebrate the National Day
“I can’t believe there’s such a magnificent flag-raising ceremony on the frontier that it’s even more shocking than watching the flag-raising in the mainland.”
On the morning of the 1st, Mr. Zhang, who came from Sichuan to the Yunnan Hekou Port on the Sino-Vietnamese border, and more than 500 army officers and soldiers, resident people, and Chinese and foreign tourists watched the national flag-raising ceremony to celebrate the 69th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
Hekou Port is the largest port in the Yunnan section of the Sino-Vietnamese border, located in Hekou County, Honghezhou, Yunnan Province, across the river from Vietnam's Old Street City, belonging to the country's type of port.
With the continuous deepening of the country's "Belt and Road" construction, as one of China's most convenient channels to connect to Southeast Asia, the inbound and outbound flow of estuary ports has grown steadily.
At 7:30 a.m. on the same day, the sun had just revealed a corner, and the restricted areas of the estuary port gathered the local people and Chinese and foreign tourists who came to watch the flag-raising ceremony early.
At 7:45, the flag-raising ceremony began on time, and the members of the national gate honor guard at the estuary border checkpoint trembled and escorted the national flag to the flag-raising platform at a healthy pace.
After the commander issued the flag-raising instructions, the flag-raiser struggled to waving his arm to draw an arc, and the bright five-star red flank spread like an "yagle spread its wings" spread the flag, accompanied by the agitated and majestic melody of the national anthem slowly rising.
"Every New Year's Day, the Spring Festival, the National Day and other significant time nodes to hold the National Day flag-raising ceremony, not only shows China's image, but also stimulate the patriotic feelings of the people of all ethnic groups on the frontier."
Soldiers of the guard who participated in the flag-raising ceremony said.
It is reported that the national honor guard responsible for the flag-raising ceremony of the estuary port is composed of more than 40 officers and soldiers from various posts at the estuary border checkpoint, from the flag-raising group of three people to the large-scale honor guard, this team has experienced more than 60 years of history, since the establishment of more than 70 national foreign affairs service tasks.
The newly revised personal income tax law adjusts China's personal income tax judgment standard from a full year to 183 days.
China's Ministry of Finance and the State Administration of Taxation said on the 30th that in order to maintain policy stability, when implementing the new personal income tax law, we will consider continuing to make preferential arrangements for overseas people, including Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan.
The person in charge said that the implementation regulations of the current personal income tax law have special preferential provisions on the taxation of overseas people, and individuals who have no residence in China but have lived for more than one year and less than five years can pay personal income tax only on the part paid by units or individuals in China.
Sections paid abroad are not required to pay personal income tax within China.
China's Ministry of Finance, the State Administration of Taxation, the National Development and Reform Commission, and the Ministry of Commerce also issued a notice to expand the scope of application of foreign investors not to levy advance income tax policies for direct investment to distribute profits.
The profits distributed by foreign investors from domestic resident enterprises in China are used for domestic direct investment to suspend the scope of application of the policy of prepaid income tax, which is expanded from foreign investment encouragement projects to all non-prohibited foreign investment projects and areas.
During the 73rd session of the United Nations General Assembly, some positive messages were released by all parties around the Korean Peninsula issue.
South Korean President Moon Jae-in relayed North Korea’s “irreversible” denuclearization and said U.S. President Donald Trump and North Korea’s supreme leader, Kim Jong Un, could meet by the end of this year.
The U.S. Department of State later said Secretary of State Mike Pompeo will visit North Korea in October to push for the implementation of commitments for a U.S.-DPRK summit in Singapore.
Since the beginning of this year, the DPRK and the ROK have broken the ice to open the road of dialogue, the leaders of the two Koreas and the DPRK and the United States have held meetings, the general trend of easing the situation on the Korean Peninsula has continued, and the principle of resolving the Korean Peninsula issue has also been upheld.
First of all, the essence of the Korean Peninsula issue is a security issue has not changed, and to achieve peace on the Korean Peninsula, the key is to properly and balance the reasonable security concerns of all parties, rather than blindly exerting pressure on each other and emphasizing one's own demands.
Secondly, in the dialogue on realizing the denuclearization of the Korean Peninsula, all relevant parties are still divided on the steps and ways to realize the denuclearization of the Korean Peninsula. Due to the long-term lack of political trust between the DPRK and the United States, there is still a strong thinking about "who comes first and after".
At the open meeting of the Security Council on the Korean Peninsula held at the United Nations Headquarters in New York a few days ago, the different voices of all parties on the issue of sanctions against the DPRK once again highlighted that these two points have not changed on the Korean Peninsula issue.
U.S. Secretary of State Mike Pompeo has insisted that sanctions on North Korea will not be lifted until the Korean Peninsula is completely denuclearized.
Russian Foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov, for his part, stressed the principle of "response by action", noting that "the weakening trend of sanctions should be the same as North Korea's steps on the road of gradual denuclearisation."
There is no doubt that all relevant parties should continue to implement the DPRK-related resolutions in a comprehensive, complete and accurate manner, but the pressure is not the purpose, and the implementation of sanctions and the promotion of a political solution are the requirements of Security Council resolutions.
As Chinese State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi said, in view of the current positive developments in the DPRK-ROK relations, China believes that it is necessary for the Security Council to consider the timely initiation of reversible terms, so as to encourage the DPRK and all relevant parties to take greater steps towards denuclearization.
Looking back on the past, the denuclearization of the Korean Peninsula and every progress in the peace process requires all parties to demonstrate sufficient political courage.
At present, in the face of the international community's expectations to promote the political settlement of the Korean Peninsula issue, all relevant parties in particular should show political strength, make political decisions, implement commitments, resolve difficult problems, continue to take steps in the same direction, advance the process of denuclearization of the Korean Peninsula in parallel with the establishment of a peace mechanism on the Peninsula, and jointly create permanent peace on the Korean Peninsula.
On the 1st, the People's Government of Jixian County, Linfen City, Shanxi Province, said that during the National Day, the scenic spot of the Yellow River Hukou waterfall in the county will maintain a relatively high water level and does not have open conditions.
In order to ensure safety, the scenic spot was temporarily closed during the National Day.
The Yellow River Butter Falls is the second largest waterfall in China and the largest yellow waterfall in the world.
The Yellow River rushes to this point, the stone walls on both sides of the strait stand, and the estuaries are as narrow as the mouth of the pot, forming the spirit of "a pot of thousands of miles of the Yellow River".
According to the reporter's understanding, from June to October each year is the Yellow River flood season, starting from July 12, 2018, due to the high water level of the Yellow River, Shanxi Yellow Rever pot scenic area has begun to close one after another, so the closure of the pot mouth scenic spot has accumulated nearly a month.
Ni Yufeng, chief engineer of the Jukou Scenic Area Management Committee, told the media that this is the longest time in the past 20 years, the high water level of the Yellow River has lasted for the longest time, "it has not been so long before, and the closure time of our flood season in 2017 is 4 days, and this year is nearly a month."
It is understood that in order to meet the "Eleven" Golden Week in Shanxi, the scenic spot of the Yellow River Hukou Falls was also added to the personnel arrangements and vehicle maintenance in advance, and even the recruitment of temporary staff has been put in place.
According to the "Notice on Doing a Good Job in the Yellow River Flood Prevention Work during the National Day" issued by the "Yellow River Flood Prevention and Drought Control Headquarters Office", it is required that Qinghai, Gansu, Ningxia, Inner Mongolia, Shanxi, Shaanxi, Henan and Shandong provinces do a good job of flood control during the National Day.
At present, the flow rate of the dry river of the Yellow River is relatively large, the flow rate of the upstream river is maintained at 2000-3000 cubic meters per second, the flow rate of the midstream river is maintained at 2,500-3,500 cubic meters per second, and the flow of the downstream river is maintained at 3,000 cubic meters per second.
Influenza Vaccination Services in Health Centres and Stations Specially on National Day Holidays
This year, the Health Bureau ordered 150,000 doses of the 2018-2019 four-valent influenza vaccine, giving priority to free vaccinations for high-risk people at this stage. In order to facilitate the vaccination of residents during the holidays, health centers and health stations under the Health Bureau provide vaccination services from 9 a.m. to 1 p.m. on the National Day holiday (October 1-2).
In addition to the above-mentioned convenience measures, health centers and health stations under the Health Bureau have extended their plans for influenza vaccination services from Monday to Friday to 8 p.m. As of 4 p.m. on September 30, 4,158 people have been vaccinated, compared with more than 3,714 in the same period last year.
Complimentary vaccinations include the following Macao residents: persons under the age of 18, persons aged 50 and above, pregnant women, all people with chronic diseases, including obese persons (i.e. people with a body mass BMI of 30 or above), as well as the staff of institutions, nurseries, kindergartens, primary schools and secondary schools, all health workers, and Macao residents who work in casinos.
At the same time, the Health Bureau deems it necessary to vaccinate other personnel, including the public sector, and the Health Bureau will take the initiative to contact the relevant agencies to obtain the list arranged by the health centers.
In order to facilitate the vaccinators and reduce the waiting time for vaccination, from October to December this year, the Health Bureau will send medical personnel to local secondary schools, primary schools, kindergartens and nurseries to carry out collective influenza vaccination for young children, primary and secondary school students, teachers and employees; in addition, the Health Bureau will also arrange people to the elderly and disabled homes, public departments or other institutions for collective vaccination.
Students and young children who are unable to participate in collective vaccination can be vaccinated at the Vaccination Station or the Health Centre at the Macau Resident Identity Card, Health Bureau User Card, Influenza Vaccination Card (if any), student's certificate, employee card or occupational certificate documents from December 3, 2018.
The Health Bureau reminded residents that between September 2017 and August 2018, those who had been vaccinated against the 2017-2018 influenza vaccine still need to be vaccinated for the new season of influenza vaccine from September 2018, because the influenza antigen components contained in the 2018-2019 Northern Hemisphere influenza vaccine have been updated, which is aimed at seasonal influenza in the winter of 2018-2019 in the northern hemisphere.
Macao's influenza peak period is usually from January to March each year, later than in temperate areas (such as northern China and Japan), the Health Bureau calls on the elderly, children, pregnant women, obese people and chronically conspicues, such as the elderly, pregnant women, obese people and people with chronic diseases, who are more prone to complications and those who are often in contact with high-risk people, should be vaccinated as soon as possible.
