After the ship is completed, it will be delivered to the Donghai Branch of the State Oceanic Administration of China, and Chen Sheng, director of the observation department of the marine early warning monitoring department of China's Ministry of Natural Resources, said that the ship's use will be of great significance for the development of China's offshore marine observation system and the promotion of global marine observation.
On September 29, China's first 3,000-ton large-scale buoy ship "Xingyang Red 22" ship was launched into the water of China's martial ship group.
After the completion of the ship, it will break China's current equipment bottlenecks in large-scale buoys, submersible placement, recycling, and repair.
"Shangyang Red 22" wheel is mainly used for the regular inspection and maintenance of buoys/submersibles, regular laying, recycling, buoys/submersible emergency laying, recycling, repair and other protection work, and have the ability to carry out comprehensive marine investigation tasks such as cross-sectional surveys.
The total length of the new ship is 89 meters, the type is 18 meters wide, the type is 7.2 meters deep, and the endurance is 10,000 nautical miles.
Wang Weiling, deputy general manager of Wushuan Group, said: "Xianyanghong 22 ship is China's first large-scale buoy operating ship, but also the only in China has the ability to lift ten meters of large-scale buoy operation ships, will further enhance China's large-scale buoy security capabilities."
It is understood that after the completion of the ship will be delivered to China's National Oceanic Administration Donghai Branch, China's Ministry of Natural Resources Marine Early Warning Monitoring Director of the Department of Observation, Chen Sheng said that the ship will be put into use for the development of China's offshore marine observation system, the promotion of global marine observation is of great significance.
"This ship also has a large-scale floating sterling cloth maintenance operation, but also has the ability of comprehensive marine investigation, is China's first dedicated to COSCO sea buoy operations and marine comprehensive investigation of the integrated ship."
With such a buoy operating vessel, our marine observations and marine surveys will have a powerful tool in the future.”
Affected by Typhoon "Tanmei", the 2018 International Extreme Sailing Series Qingdao Station "Mazerun Cup", which was originally scheduled to start on September 30, postponed the first competition day to October 1st, and held a pre-race meeting at the Qingdao Aofan Center before the game, and the captains of 12 hydrofoil capacities from 6 countries and regions were all unveiled.
Affected by Typhoon "Tanmei", the strong winds in the Hong Kong pool continued, the maximum wind speed was even as high as 24 knots, the sailing signal was postponed for nearly 90 minutes from 1 p.m. on the 30th, the wind speed was still not reduced, and the tournament referee Annie Mudrant announced the cancellation of the first day of the game and postponed the competition until the afternoon of October 1.
â€œThe strong winds blowing from the shore continue, and the sea conditions are too severe.â€
"In such a situation, no one knows when the gusts will blow the boat with what kind of wind.
Close to the city's arena, in terms of the current wind conditions, the cancellation of the game is the wisest choice."
Everything that was ready for the crew was still somewhat disappointed.
â€œThe boat is ready to stop, and we are in good shape.â€
"But I know that the rescheduling of the game is the right choice, and I hope that today's wind energy is smaller, we can show off."
Known as New Zealand's "Star of Hope" for the 2020 Tokyo Olympics, Omika Wilkinson said: "Losing a day makes the competition even more interesting.
Because today's game weight will increase, and there are only two days left to play.
Everyone is going to work hard.”
Although the sea breeze is fierce, the French ABM rudder Pierre Ivis Durand in the pre-match meeting will appeal their warm past with Qingdao, where the competition is held: five years ago, the international extreme sailing series was accidentally injured, the muscles were broken, thanks to the treatment of the medical team of the local events, so that they can still stand on the field of the game five years later today.
It is reported that the international extreme sailing series was founded in 2007 and is in line with Volvo, the America's Cup, the World Sailing Against Tour and other events.
The Qingdao station competition will use the "Flying Ghost" hydrofoil (FlyingPhantom).
2018 is the 8th year of the event landing in the "sailing capital" of Qingdao, and Qingdao Station is also the closing battle of the series.
Although the global financial market turmoil continued, the Hong Kong Monetary Authority said on Monday that the foreign exchange fund's investment income in the third quarter of this year fell by 97% year-on-year, but better than the performance of the previous quarter, because under the Sino-US trade war, overseas stocks rose, and foreign exchange losses were significantly narrowed.
According to the latest data of the HKMA, from July to September 2018, the Exchange Fund recorded investment income of HK$1.6 billion, which was significantly lower than HK$61.8 billion in the same period last year, but it was better than the revised HK$100 million in the second quarter of this year.
Chen Delin, president of the HKMA, said at the legislative meeting that at the beginning of the Sino-US trade war, the Hong Kong and emerging market stock indexes ran counter to the U.S. stock index, until at the end of September and the beginning of October, the U.S. stock market index began to reverse, because investors gradually realized that the trade war was also detrimental to the United States itself.
â€œChange in market sentiment is a good thing, if the trade war has only a one-sided impact, it will do little to solve things.â€
However, he also pointed out that "if the Sino-US trade war is not resolved, financial market volatility will continue to rise."
In the third quarter of this year, the foreign exchange fund's stock investment loss in Hong Kong narrowed by 8% to HK$4.7 billion from the previous quarter, and the return on overseas stock investment increased by 172% to HK$12.8 billion; the foreign exchange loss was HK$16.2 billion, and the bond income was HK$9.7 billion, a decrease of 24% and 31% respectively, mainly reflecting the general rise of the US dollar against major currencies during the quarter and the interest rate of the United States in mid-September.
Exchange funds are mainly used to support Hong Kong dollars.
Since 1983, Hong Kong has implemented the Hong Kong dollar and the United States U.S. dollar linked exchange rate system.
For the current financial situation in Hong Kong, Chen Delin said that economic and asset market uncertainty has increased and downside risks have increased, but Hong Kong's financial system is stable, also doing a good job of defense, and has sufficient earthquake resistance.
"Hong Kong's international investment position is plentiful, the foreign net worth of 1.4 trillion US dollars is equivalent to 4 times of GDP, higher than Singapore's 2.5 times and Japan's 0.6 times, to deal with the economic downturn cycle or reverse enough."
Recently, the Hong Kong dollar interest rate continues to fall and the dollar spread expanded, Chen Delin pointed out that the Hong Kong dollar exchange rate rose more than 400 basis points on September 21, the market generally believes that it is mainly related to the rise of the Hong Kong dollar interest rate, and then the Hong Kong dollar against the United States around 7.80-7.84 around the level, to the recent Hong Kong dollar balance continues to fall, and the dollar interest spread expansion, may attract the market, buy the US dollar.
However, he believes that with the beginning of the interest rate hike cycle of Hong Kong banks and the normalization of the Hong Kong dollar interest rate, the future situation of the Hong Kong dollar interest rate below the US dollar interest rate will change.
â€œThe Hong Kong dollar interest rate will be more consistent with the trend of the US dollar interest rate, and everyone must be more careful to manage risks and be prepared to deal with market fluctuations.â€
Due to the abundant funds of the Hong Kong dollar and the further decline of the Hong Kong dollar, the three-year interest rate split fell by 0.9% to 2.08179% on Monday, and the spread with the US dollar widened from 46 basis points to 51 basis points; the one-month interest rate was at a five-month low, and the spread with the US dollar was expanded from 120 basis points to 127 basis points.
From May to mid-September, the spot exchange rate of the Hong Kong dollar was closer to 7.85 to the United States dollar for most of the time.
During this period, due to factors such as the outflow of funds from some of the prospectus after the completion of large-scale prospectus activities, due to factors such as the outflow of funds from some of the prospectus activities, the weak party exchange guarantee was triggered in May and August after being triggered for the first time in April.
In accordance with the linkage exchange rate system, the HKMA buys Hong Kong dollars at 7.85 levels and raises US dollars to maintain the stability of the Hong Kong dollar exchange rate.
The HKMA bought a total of about HK$52.1 billion in May and August under the weak party exchange guarantee mechanism.
Is the new tax law more favorable for foreigners?
In response to a reporter's question on the 30th, the relevant person in charge of the Ministry of Finance and the State Administration of Taxation said that in order to maintain policy stability, when implementing the new personal income tax law in the next step, consideration will be given to continuing to make preferential arrangements for foreigners, including Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan.
A reporter asked, the newly revised personal income tax law will adjust China's personal income tax residents' judgment standards from a full year to 183 days.
When the next step in the implementation of the law, will there be preferential arrangements for overseas people, including Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan?
In response, the person in charge said that the implementation regulations of the current personal income tax law have special preferential provisions on the payment of taxes of overseas people, and individuals who have no residence in China but have lived for more than one year and less than five years can pay personal income tax only on the part paid by units or individuals in China.
The person in charge said that in order to maintain policy stability, when implementing the new personal income tax law in the next step, consideration will be given to continuing to make preferential arrangements for overseas people, including Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan.
There is no "threshold" of the children's center: quality certification promotes the improvement of quality.
With the pull of the "two-child economy" and the prosperity of the mother and baby market, from the north to the third and fourth-tier cities, there have been a variety of tranches of monthly clubhouses.
At present, a very fiery monthly club meets the consumption needs of the masses, charging fees ranging from tens of thousands of yuan to hundreds of thousands of yuan, but at the same time, it is also in an embarrassing situation, there is no threshold for this institution so far, and there are still gaps in supervision.
The State General Administration of Market Supervision recently carried out a series of activities of the national "quality month" in 2018, and the reporter came to a five-star children's center in Tianjin to visit the certification experience of maternal and child care services.
The general children's center provides services such as neonatal care, nutritious meals, and postpartum repair shapes.
In this center, the reporter saw that the nurse checked the breastfeeding situation of the newborn every day, and the professional nurse provided fine care services such as bathing and touching for the newborn.
At the same time, in order to meet the needs of new mothers, from the early wound care of the month, to services such as mid-to-late beauty care, Chinese medicine treatment and beauty care projects are provided to help the mothers recover.
A new mom who lives told reporters that she only booked for this monthly club eight months in advance.
The service project of the monthly club directly affects the degree of comfort and physical recovery during the mother's month, and some small-scale monthly associations can only provide some simple monthly services, there are problems such as irregular disinfection and hygiene, easy cross-infection, and a single unscientific diet.
The person in charge of the center said that they are the only one of all the five-star sub-centers in Tianjian to obtain B-level service certification.
"Although some customers did not understand the meaning of B-level certification at first, but through the certification forced enterprises to strictly standardized process management, so that customers benefit, is of great significance to the long-term development of enterprises."
Pan Lifen, deputy director of the certification supervision department of the State Administration of Market Supervision, said that service certification is a new certification system based on customer perception and attention to organizational quality management and service characteristics, which is an important part of the country's quality infrastructure, and plays a positive role in improving the proportion of high-quality service supply and enhancing China's international service competitiveness.
Starting from 2004, after more than 10 years of development, the service certification project has experienced from scratch, the gradual development process, such as financial service certification, maternal and child care service certification, after-sales service certification, e-commerce service certification, health service certification and a number of service certification with a certain influence.
According to the statistics of the State Administration of Market Supervision, there are currently more than 130 service certification institutions in China, more than 2,000 service certification personnel, and nearly 8,000 effective certification certificates.
Pan Lifen said that it is necessary to further guide and promote the development of service certification, gradually expand service certification coverage in the fields of health, education, sports, finance, and e-commerce, and promote the reform and quality improvement of the supply side of the service industry.
HONG KONG, Nov 5 (Reuters) - Hong Kong property prices fell for two consecutive months after peaking, and Hong Kong Monetary Authority President Chen Delin said on Monday that it would take time to observe whether the housing market has entered a downward cycle, if confirmed, it can be considered to relax the tightening of counter-cyclical measures in due course.
Chen Delin also pointed out that if the property price is adjusted back, it will first be affected by the peak of the housing market, but it is expected that there will be a sharp decline in property prices such as the Asian financial crisis in 1997, and the opportunity for the public to sell properties sharply is much lower.
Chen Delin led a number of high-level HKMA officials to attend the Legislative Council briefing and said that if it is confirmed that the property market has entered a downward cycle, measures can be relaxed in appropriate times.
"But at present, we only see the data for a few weeks, it is still too early to relax, and there is still more time to see if the housing market is entering the downward cycle."
Since the 10th of 2009, the HKMA has successively launched eight rounds of counter-cyclical measures to significantly tighten the mortgages of various properties, including reducing the number of mortgages and the need for mortgage applicants to pass rigorous stress tests to improve bank risk management and earthquake resistance.
As Hong Kong officially entered the interest rate hike cycle, from August to September, the index of private residential property prices in Hong Kong peaked for two consecutive months, and the monthly decline widened to 1.44% in September.
However, in the first three quarters of this year, the cumulative increase still reached 10.2%.
In the second quarter of this year, the proportion of households in Hong Kong who did not have a mortgage reached 66%, which was higher than the average of 60% in 2009-11; the contribution-to-income ratio of the average number of newly approved mortgages and new mortgages was 47% and 34%, respectively, compared with 64% and 41% in 2009-11.
However, Chen Delin said that the high anti-seismic ability does not mean that the residents of real estate will not be damaged by the economic downturn, because the valuation of the property will fall, and those who buy buildings at the peak will bear the brunt.
Although the HKMA has tightened bank lending to mortgage lenders, home buyers can also obtain high levels of mortgage loans through mortgage insurance or mortgage loans provided by developers.
At present, together with the mortgage loans provided to developers, the borrower's Mortgage can reach 85-90%, and if the property price falls by 10%, there will be negative assets (i.e., the market value of the property falls below the level of total outstanding mortgage loans).
However, the vice president of the HKMA, Ruan Guoheng, pointed out that the authorities estimate that the total amount of mortgages provided by developers is only 2-2.5% of the total bank's mortgages, and the proportion is still low.
At the peak of negative assets in Hong Kong in 2003, there were more than 100,000 negative assets, accounting for 22% of the proportion of builders.
As of the third quarter of this year, Hong Kong recorded zero negative assets for seven consecutive seasons.
BEIJING, Oct. 1 (Xinhua) -- E-commerce retail export enterprises ushered in another wave of tax profits on October 1, involving value-added tax, consumption tax exemption and so on.
The Ministry of Finance, the State Administration of Taxation, the Ministry of Commerce and the General Administration of Customs recently jointly issued a document clarifying that for the export of e-commerce export enterprises in the cross-border e-commerce comprehensive pilot zone without obtaining effective purchase certificates of goods, at the same time meeting the following conditions, trial VAT and consumption tax exemption policies.
First, e-commerce export enterprises are registered in the comprehensive test area, and in the registration of cross-border e-commerce online comprehensive service platform to register the export date, cargo name, measurement unit, quantity, unit price, amount.
Second, export goods go through the customs of the comprehensive test area through the e-commerce export declaration formalities.
Third, the exported goods do not belong to the Ministry of Finance and the State Administration of Taxation, in accordance with the decision of the State Council to clearly cancel the export refund (exemption) of the goods.
It is clear that the General Administration of Customs regularly transmits the electronic information of the e-commerce export commodity declaration list to the State Administration of Taxation.
The tax authorities in the comprehensive test area have strengthened the tax-free management of export goods in accordance with the electronic information of the export commodity declaration list of the State Administration of Taxation.
The notice pointed out that the specific tax exemption management measures are formulated by the financial and commercial departments of the provincial tax departments.
The office of the leading group for the construction of various comprehensive test areas and the competent departments of commerce should comprehensively promote the communication and coordination between departments and the implementation of relevant policies, accelerate the establishment of an e-commerce export statistical monitoring system, and promote the healthy and rapid development of cross-border e-commerce.
Nov. 5 (Zhang Linhu) due to differences in the distribution of money, a man in Liaoning Province actually killed his lover and dumped his body, and then absconded to the Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region.
On the 5th, the reporter learned from the Public Security Bureau of Dongsheng District of Ordos City, Inner Mongolia, that after a joint investigation by the police in both places, the man was successfully arrested.
On June 26, 2018, a woman in Anshan City, Liaoning Province, disappeared, and her family called the local police.
According to the investigation and judgment of the police, this is not a simple case of missing people, and the missing person is likely to be killed by his lover Wang, and the police immediately set up a task force to conduct further investigations.
On October 30, the task force found that the criminal suspect Wang may be hiding in Dongsheng District of Ordos City, and the Dongsheng police immediately organized competent police forces to fully cooperate with the Liaoning police to solve the case.
After 5 days of investigation, the police finally found out Wang's foothold and combed in detail about his relationship.
On November 4th, the police of the two places worked together to arrest the criminal suspect Wang in an excavator accessory store in Dongsheng District.
According to Wang's account, he had a relationship with the victim's lover, because Bai's sister had a large amount of money to survive in the white name, and the two decided to occupy the money as their own.
On June 22, 2018, when Wang and Bai had a disagreement over the control of the funds, Wang went on to kill Bai in the rental house, decomposing the body.
At present, the criminal suspect Wang has been handed over to Liaoning Anshan police.
"Five development beautiful Anhui" "green development in action" theme train online operation
"Five major development, beautiful Anhui" the second theme train - "green development in action" theme train was officially put into operation on the 5th.
In order to fully demonstrate the brilliant achievements made in the construction work of "Five Developments and Beautiful Anhui", Hefei Railway Co., Ltd. jointly designed and produced a series of theme trains of "Five Major Developments and Beautiful Anhui".
Among them, the first train, "innovation and development in action", was officially put into operation on October 1 in Hefei Rail Transit Line 1.
The theme train on the line selected the blue and green that symbolizes the landscape, reflecting the birth machine, vitality and purity sense.
The publicity content highlights the core ideas and concepts of the "five major development and beautiful Anhui" and the 18 representative green development achievements in the province, including the construction and development results of key green development projects such as the Jianghuai Canal project, the forest system, the protection and development of the Yangtze River Economic Belt, and the tens of millions of acres of forest growth projects.
In addition, "coordinated development in action", "open development in action", "shared development in action" three themed trains will also be online in the near future.
SHENZHEN, Oct. 1 (Zheng Xiaohong 徐殿伟 Liu Yimeng) October 1 is the first day of the mainland National Day "Golden Week", but also the last day of the Hong Kong National Day public holiday, many mainland residents use the holiday to go abroad to play, shopping, there are many deep Hong Kong residents returned to Hong Kong on the same day, Shenzhen ports appeared in the passenger flow "explosion" situation, Luohu, Shenzhen Bay Port newly opened 22 self-service channels to improve the efficiency of customs clearance.
According to the data provided by the Shenzhen border inspection terminal, as of 16:00 p.m. on the same day, the number of arrivals and departures at the Shenzhen port reached more than 429,000, and the number of transportation vehicles reached more than 16,800 (ships, shelves, columns), and the ports were always busy and chaotic, maintaining a good entry and exit order.
It is understood that due to the increase in the number of favorable factors such as the increase in the number of countries providing outbound visa-free policies for Chinese citizens, the number of tourists who take advantage of holiday shopping in Europe and Southeast Asia and other countries will continue to increase.
On the morning of the 1st, Luohu, Shenzhen Bay, Huanggang, Futian and other ports ushered in the peak of passenger (car) flow, of which Luohu port passenger flow peak from 9:00 a.m. to 11:00 a.m., Shenzhen Bay port passenger (car) peak from 6:30 a.m. to 13:00 p.m.
According to reports, in order to deal with the peak of inbound and outbound passengers (cars), the Shenzhen border inspection terminal in accordance with the unified deployment of the National Immigration Administration, start the passenger (vehicle) flow peak service mode, arrange overtime police to support the first line of duty, open the inspection channel in advance, guide passengers and vehicles to wait for inspection in an orderly manner, to ensure that Chinese citizens enter and exit customs queuing for no more than 30 minutes, while taking into account the efficiency of customs clearance for foreigners;
At the same time, the Shenzhen border inspection terminal reminds inbound and outbound passengers that they should pay attention to the validity period of documents and visas and signatures before traveling, arrange the itinerary reasonably, try to avoid the peak period of passenger flow, and choose the appropriate time and the appropriate port to travel.
Passengers traveling to Hong Kong on the Guangzhou-Shenzhen-Hong Kong high-speed rail are required to hold a valid entry-exit certificate and visa signature, the high-speed rail ticket is only a travel voucher, can not be used as an entry-exit certificate, such as due to non-conformity of documents and other reasons can not go out to Hong Kong, you should follow the guidance of the police on duty at the border inspection, to the designated place to wait for the staff of the MTR company to go back to the mainland.
The systemic lupus erythematosus is a chronic and difficult disease that affects multiple organs throughout the body, and was once considered an "incurable disease".
Due to the lack of pathogenesis, difficult diagnosis and treatment, the lack of effective treatment methods can not be cured.
Recently, Liu Wanli, a researcher at the School of Life Sciences of Tsinghua University, and the joint team of the rheumatic immunity center of Peking University People's Hospital found that human immunoglobulins have molecular variants that increase the susceptibility to systemic lupus, and this variant is involved in regulating immune B cells.
In short, the two teams confirmed that an abnormal immune molecule in the human body is an important cause of systemic lupus disease.
According to one of the authors of the article, Sun Xiaolin of Peking University People's Hospital, the team collected nearly 2,000 large samples of systemic lupus patients and conducted research, and found that patients with immunoglobulin mutation produced a wide range of pathogenic cells and a large number of autoantibodies, and the incidence and severity of inflammation such as nephritis, arthritis, pyritis, and vasivitis increased significantly.
Through a variety of research methods such as immune cell tracking, animal testing, and sequencing, Liu Wanli's team found that the immune signaling pathway activated by this immune molecular mutation promotes the pathogenic mechanism of B cells to secrete a variety of autoantibodies.
The reporter learned that the two teams are strong together, giving full play to their respective advantages, and realizing the close combination of basic research and clinical applications.
Liu Wanli's team is committed to B lymphocyte immune recognition and immunoactivation research, and the team has long been engaged in clinical studies of systemic lupus erythematosus.
"This research is one of the results of many years of cooperation between the two teams, and it is also the first time that the academic community has recognized in the mechanism that immunoglobulin gene abnormalities will induce systemic lupus, laying a solid foundation for further academic research and clinical targeted treatment."
This is not to take care, but to act in accordance with the law.
A lawyer carrying an axe in court?
The news is indeed very exciting at first glance, and it has also exploded in the legal circle.
Fujian Quanzhou City Law then fined the lawyers involved 500 yuan, and suggested in writing that Quanzhou Bar Association investigate and deal with them.
According to the Beijing News, a few days ago, the Quanzhou Law Association issued an official notice saying that the behavior of the two lawyers does not involve violations and will not be punished in accordance with the law.
Judging from multiple reports, the treatment of Quanzhou Law Association is not short or confrontation, but it has been recognized by Quanzhou Middle Court.
An event that could have triggered tensions within the legal community was eventually properly resolved.
The reversal of the matter stems from a more complete restoration of the truth: the axe carried by the lawyer involved is in the same style as the defendant's murder weapon, the same model, but it does not open the blade, and only provides auxiliary evidence in the cross-examination of evidence, and there is no subjective intention of intimidating actions or "endangering the safety of the court".
Judging whether the lawyer's behavior is illegal and illegal, there are four very important details to pay attention to: first, the local court has held two court sessions, only showing axe photos, from the defense point of view, it is necessary to show the axe of the original; second, the axe was purchased one hour before the trial, not that the lawyer was unwilling to seek the consent of the judge, but objectively failed to contact the judge; third, the entire axe was not overstated or improperly used.
Combined with these circumstances, it can be seen that the lawyers involved have nothing to do wrong with "taking an axe to appear in court", but only for defense.
After clarifying the whole facts, the Quanzhou Municipal Law Association did not push the boat along the water, but resisted the pressure to make a decision not to punish.
And this decision can withstand the testing of facts and laws.
As for bringing to the court as an axe that controls knives without the permission of the court, it is indeed easy to cause anxiety and misunderstanding.
Due to safety and prudency considerations, the previous fines and judicial recommendations of Quanzhou Middle Court are also understandable.
In order to safeguard the dignity of lawyers and prevent individual courts from taking advantage of them, the Supreme People's Court issued the "Rules for Judicial Police Security Inspection of People's Courts" in 2014, which established the principle that lawyers do not need to carry out personal safety checks in court.
Since the release of this rule, the majority of lawyers have led by example, and there have rarely been incidents that have jeopardized the security of the court due to security loopholes.
In very few cases such as Quanzhou, as long as there is communication in the spirit of mutual respect and understanding, misunderstandings are not difficult to eliminate.
As a self-regulatory organization in the legal profession, the Bar Association undertakes the dual mission of disciplining and ensuring legality.
In the past, individual law association organizations were criticized for their focus on discipline and lack of protection.
The decision of the Quanzhou Law Association, both in terms of the process and the results, is commendable, setting an example for more legal associations to perform their duties correctly.
From October 1st, which tax benefits will affect our money bags?
Xinhua News Agency, Shanghai, October 1 (Reporter Sang Tong) The new personal income tax law will come into effect on January 1, 2019, in order to let the broad masses of the people enjoy the tax reduction dividend as soon as possible, from October 1st, the actual salary and salary income obtained by taxpayers will be deducted according to the starting point of 5,000 yuan per month, and the new tax rate table will be applied.
With the landing of the New Deal, what are the benefits that will affect the people's money bags?
Good one: the tax reduction of wages and salaries is obvious
Taxpayers who have obtained wages and salaries after October 1 can deduct 5,000 yuan/month's basic deduction fees and apply the new tax schedule, and most taxpayers have different degrees of tax cuts, especially for low- and middle-income earners.
According to the tax reduction table of different income groups, after deducting the "three risks and one gold" of the monthly income of 8,000 yuan, 10000 yuan, 20,000 yuan, 50,000 yuan of people, after the tax should be 90 yuan, 290 yuan, 1590 yuan, 9090 yuan, compared with the starting point of 3500 yuan, the corresponding tax reduction ratio is 73.9%, 61.1%, 49.0%, 18.8%.
It is worth noting that due to the reasons for the holidays, the wages that should have been paid in October by various units at the end of September in accordance with the law can be applied to the new basic reduction fees and tax rates.
To this end, the withholding client software used uniformly promoted by the tax department has provided the corresponding tax calculation function, but the corresponding tax still needs to be declared and paid during the statutory declaration period.
Benefit two: low tax level distance is significantly larger
In addition to increasing the starting point, the new tax rate table will be applied from October 1.
This salary, salary income of the seven tranches of the same as before, there is no change, but the tax rate distance has changed significantly, 3%, 100%, 20% of the third tranche of the low tax rating distance is significantly expanded, 25% of the tax rate distance has been reduced, while 30%, 35%, 45% of the three levels of higher tax rates remained unchanged.
It is worth noting that the tax law also adjusts the tax rate of all grades of production and operation income, among which the lower limit of the highest-end 35% tax rate has been increased from 100,000 yuan to 500,000 yuan.
This means that individual industrial and commercial households and sole proprietorships will all benefit from tax reform.
"Judging from the calculation of individual tax cuts for Shanghai taxpayers in the early period, the majority of taxpayers will fully feel the dividends of individual tax reform, especially for low- and middle-income people."
Lan Min, head of the personal income tax department of the Shanghai Municipal Taxation Bureau of the State Administration of Taxation, said.
Third, tax payment services are more easily optimized
Since the promulgation of the new personal income tax law, the Shanghai tax department has carried out a series of comprehensive and extensive tax publicity actions.
On the one hand, "one-to-one, peer-to-peer" policy guidance is carried out for key tax sources and key enterprises.
Pudong New Area Taxation Bureau has visited Apple Trading (Shanghai) Co., Ltd., Alipay (China) Network Technology Co., Ltd., Hongxing Mei Kailong Household Group Co., Ltd. and other large enterprises, the number of employees of these enterprises is large, withholding the payment workload is large, the tax amount is large, the tax department takes the initiative to guide, answer questions; Xuhui District Taxation Bureau visited the region's large labor enterprises Zhongzhi Financial Consulting Co.
On the other hand, for the majority of public taxpayers, carry out the "all-round, multi-dimensional, three-dimensional" tax policy push.
Make use of Shanghai tax official websites, WeChat public accounts, Weibo and other channels to push policy hotspots in time to ensure that policy publicity is in place.
At the same time, since September 28th, the Shanghai tax WeChat public number launched 12366 intelligent consulting platform, through the "artificial + intelligent" tax service consultation, to carry out the "targeted" intelligent integration of individual tax reform publicity services.
On the evening of Beijing time on the 4th, the official website of the English FA officially announced that former England captain Rooney will return to the English national team and play in the warm-up match against the United States on November 15.
In August last year, Rooney announced that he would withdraw from the England national team.
Rooney had previously represented England 119 times, scoring 53 goals, being the team's all-time top scorer, ranking second in history.
According to the FA's official website, this and the U.S. team's game is to raise funds for Rooney's children's charitable foundation, and Rooney himself is very excited: "It's a pleasure to represent England at Wembley again, thanking Southgate and the FA for inviting me to help my foundation.
Playing for England is the greatest glory of my career, the 120th and it will also be my last appearance for England, and for me it will be a special memory."
The annual Yangcheng Lake Crab Cultural Tourism Festival kicked off on the 30th, according to Gu Wenhua, secretary of the party party committee of "Yangcheng Lake Dazhong Crab Town", revealed that at present, the annual economic output value of the town's big crab is nearly 3.8 billion yuan, and the net income exceeds 600 million yuan.
Yangcheng Lake crab is also known as the golden claw crab, because the crab body is not covered with mud, commonly known as the clear water crab, the blue shell white belly, the meat is greasy, so there is the reputation of "king of the crab".
The golden-autumn eclipse of tangui has become a common practice.
The crab is the most well-known image spokesperson in Bacheng.
Peaking crab shells, sucking crab feet, picking crab meat, dipping crab materials, diners feel the beauty of being in Jiangnan.
Crab farmer Jinwei introduced that this year, more diners will spend more time staying in Bacheng, watching the white egret on the edge of Yangcheng Lake, enjoying the sunset, experiencing the fun of catching crabs, and enjoying the slow-temporary aquatic life.
Due to the general introduction of large-scale seedlings in Pakistani towns and cities, this year's effluent crab is much larger than before.
For nearly 20 years, Crab Farmer Chang Jianhua is planning to export the crab seedlings and farming technology of Yangcheng Lake to Thailand, so that Shuixiang cuisine crosses national borders and promotes cultural exchanges with overseas cuisines.
"Kunqu Town" is a piece of cultural signature in Bacheng.
At present, Bacheng has built crab garlands, fisherman's lights, spring and autumn water city, Linhu crab city, Zhengyi Bazaar crab market five crab market and food a street, around Yangcheng Lake crab to do catering business as many as 1,300 restaurants as many as 1,300, scaly claws compared with all kinds of crambs dazzling dazzling, the passenger flow peak when the car water maroon has become a unique scenery.
Gu Wenhua introduced that "a crab" attracts nearly 3 million tourists at home and abroad every year, and has also formed a two-silver, lively old street.
Baxi station Kunqu themed post office, painting concept book bar, pink baby theme image museum, Kunqu theme homestay, embroidery museum, cheongsam museum and many other tourism products have been unveiled, Kunqu scholar Yang Shousong, flute master Chen Dongbao, the famous Kunqu Xiaosheng Yulin, bamboo craft master Ni Xiaozhou, folk song inheritor Lu Zhenliang and a number of other celebrity studios have settled.
It is reported that during the Crab Cultural Tourism Festival, the 4th Kunqu Town and Bacheng Rejuvenation will also kick off again, from all over the world's communicators will gather together to revisit the Yushan Yaya Festival.
A number of cultural venues such as the Bacheng Historical and Cultural Exhibition Center, the Kunqu Promenade, the Aying Yayuan, Chong Literature Academy, and the Kun Opera Theatre will also be unveiled, showing the cultural charm of Kunquyuan Township, the hometown of Chinese calligraphy, and Jiangnan Fish and Water Township.
Reaching a three-way trade agreement between the United States and Mexico will open up new opportunities for 500 million people.
According to foreign media reports, Canadian Foreign Minister Freeland and U.S. Trade Representative Lighthizer's joint statement released by the Canadian government's website said that the United States, Canada and Mexico reached a trilateral trade agreement, which will be known as the "USMCA" (the U.S.-Mexico-Canada Trilateral Agreement).
Earlier, Canada's CTV News TV quoted senior U.S. sources as saying that Canada and the United States eliminated their differences and reached an agreement on the North American Free Trade Agreement (NAFTA).
The Washington Post quoted two sources with knowledge of the situation as saying that the agreement reached between the United States and Canada on September 30 will retain the North American Free Trade Agreement as a tripartite trade agreement, and the three heads of state will sign a new agreement within two months.
“Today, Canada, the U.S., and Mexico have agreed on a new trade deal, the U.S.-Mexico-Canada Agreement (U.S.MCA), which will provide high standards for our workers, farmers, and companies to provide high-standard trade deals that will lead to freer markets, fairer deals, and more sustainable economic growth.
It is reported that the current North American Free Trade Agreement was signed by the United States, Mexico and Canada in 1994.
After taking office, Trump announced that he planned to reconsider the agreement and sign the new agreement.
Since 2017, the three countries have started this negotiation process.
Due to the death of the former governor, Weng Changxiongzhi, and the early election of the governor of Okinawa announced the results in the early morning of the 1st local time, and Yucheng Danny, who opposes the relocation plan of the U.S. military base in Japan, was successfully elected.
The election was held on September 30, and the final results showed that Yucheng won a total of 396.632 million votes, creating the largest number of votes in the history of the Okinawa Prefectural governor's election, with more than 80,000 votes more than his main campaign opponent, Sao Xianxun.
A total of four candidates participated in the election, with a turnout of 63.24%, down 0.89 percentage points from the 2014 Okinawa Prefecture governor's election.
Yucheng told the media on the 1st that the results of the election showed that the prefectural people did not want the efforts of Governor Weng in vain, and he would continue to make efforts to the Japanese government and the U.S. government on opposing the relocation plan of the U.S. military base and the closure of Putian.
The U.S. U.S. military base is located in Yino Bay City, Okinawa Prefecture, and has been criticized, and the Japanese and U.S. governments have previously agreed to relocate it to the benano ancient area, but the people of Okinawa strongly oppose it and hope to completely move the base out of Okinawa.
As for the relocation plan strongly opposed by the prefectural people and the requirement to revoke the land reclamation permit on the ancient shores of Bino, Yucheng said that at the beginning, he did not stand in opposition with the central government and divided positions, hoping that the two sides would fully exchange views and show the intention of resolving them through consultations.
On the morning of the 1st, Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe also told the media that he will earnestly accept this result and will make efforts to revitalize Okinawa and reduce the burden on bases.
Japan's Chief Cabinet Secretary Yoshihide Suga said at a press conference on the 1st that there has been no change in the government's policy on relocating the U.S. military base as soon as possible.
At the same time, he also expressed his intention to hold talks with Yucheng.
Yucheng will officially take office as governor of Okinawa Prefecture on the 4th of this month.
Since the mid-2000s, as China’s demand for oilseeds has growned, U.S. North Dakota farmer Paul Thomas has grown more and more soybeans in his land.
The transition peaked this year, when he planted 1,600 acres of soybeans on 5,000 acres, on an unprecedented scale.
But Thomas and many farmers like him plan to switch to the former staple food crop of the U.S. agricultural district in 2019: corn and wheat.
U.S. farmers planted more soybeans than corn this year for the first time in 35 years.
Other food crops are planned because U.S. farmers are struggling to sell soybeans in the context of U.S. President Donald Trump’s trade war with China.
China usually buys about 60 percent of U.S. soybean exports, but because of the trade war, almost zero purchases of U.S. soybeans in recent months have caused soybean prices to fall to a ten-year low.
Thomas plans to grow more wheat next year, hoping to earn more by reducing his reliance on crops that depend on Chinese demand.
Thomas said that soybean prices "bring us a painful blow".
He said there was no Chinese demand, and the spot price for soybeans near his farm was $7.10 per bushel, compared with $8.50 necessary to cover costs.
U.S. farmers have set record levels for soybean planting this year, and harvests are also expected to hit record highs.
It was at such a vulnerable time that they were hit by a trade war.
In response to Trump's imposition of tariffs on imported Chinese goods, China imposed import tariffs on imported U.S. soybeans in July.
The U.S. Department of Agriculture will release its first forecast for next year's planting area, which is expected to include considerations on the impact of tariffs.
It is expected that the forecast will confirm the expectations of private institutions for the reduction in sowing area of soybeans.
According to a report seen by Reuters, Informa Economics predicted on October 19 that maize cultivation will increase by 4 percent to 92.7 million acres (37.5 million hectares) in 2019, and soybean cultivation will be reduced by 7% to 83 million acres.
Informa also expects U.S. wheat cultivation to increase by 4 percent.
Soybeans planted before retaliatory tariffs rose to 89.6 million acres this year, about 15 million acres higher than a decade ago.
Corn cultivation has increased by less than 5 million acres since 2008 to 89.1 million, and this year’s wheat planting area is 47.8 million acres, close to the lowest level in 100 years.
Aron Carlson, president of the Illinois Corn Growers Association, owns 3,600 acres, spending nearly half of this year growing soybeans, but plans to cut them in the future.
He said it is possible to increase corn cultivation by up to 20 percent on his farm in northern Illinois; the state is the largest soybean-growing state in the United States.
Soybeans yield less per acre than corn, but also require less fertilizer, which makes soybeans generally less expensive to grow.
If farmers move to final corn, they may raise costs, but it will benefit some companies, including those who sell fertilizers at Andersons Inc.
Andersons CEO Pat Bowe told Reuters that he expects replanting corn to be beneficial for fertilizer use.
Bayer is also expected to benefit from farmers switching to corn.
Sutilava, director of the Airport Management Bureau in Bangkok, Thailand, held a press conference on the 29th to apologize for a Chinese citizen's beating at the airport, and said that Thailand welcomes Chinese tourists, and the relevant departments will strengthen management, improve service awareness, and avoid similar incidents.
According to reports, on the 27th, the security guard at Dongman Airport had physical clashes with a Chinese man who was denied entry.
Sutilava stated that the security guard was in serious violation of discipline, that the Airport Authority had suspended him, and that a commission of inquiry had been set up in accordance with the procedure to investigate the matter, and that the security guard would be dismissed if the matter was true.
At present, Thailand's immigration department has arranged for the man to fly back to China.
Sutilava apologized for the incident that damaged Thailand's image, said that the Thai side attaches great importance to this matter, is willing to do its best to reduce the impact of the incident on the hit tourists, and through the Chinese Embassy in Thailand will send an apology letter to the parties.
He saided that Dangman Airport is willing to facilitate Chinese tourists to Thailand, and jointly with the Thai Immigration Bureau to set up special entry channels for Chinese tourists at five major Thai international airports such as Suvarnapu, Guangman, Chiang Mai, Phuket, and Hayai in Bangkok.
He said that in the next step, the Airport Management Bureau will carry out rectification and rectification of the landing visa area, explacing the cost of landing visas, and improving the service quality and communication ability of the staff.
When the Chinese Embassy in Thailand learned of the incident, it contacted the parties as soon as possible to understand what had happened.
At the same time, he lodged representations with the heads of the Thai Immigration Bureau, the Airport Authority, and the Ministry of Tourism and Sports, asking the Thai side to thoroughly investigate the incident, severely punish the perpetrators, and will continue to maintain close communication with the Thai side to properly handle the matter and safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of the parties concerned.
Xinhua International Review: Safeguarding multilateralism, China's unity of knowledge and action.
At a time when unilateralism is surging, international rules and the multilateral order have been affected.
To some extent, the confrontation between unilateralism and multilateralism has entered a critical period.
As a responsible major country, with the concept and solid and powerful actions of the general trend and the road, China will work together with the international community to safeguard multilateralism and promote the continuous advancement of multilateralism.
In the face of new challenges in the new situation, China has issued a loud voice on the development direction and path of multilateralism.
As State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi said in his speech at the general debate of the 73rd session of the United Nations General Assembly, multilateralism in the new era should adhere to the goal of win-win cooperation, based on rules and order, with fairness and justice as the thrust, and guided by effective actions.
At the same time, China calls for building a global development cooperation pattern with the United Nations as the core, North-South cooperation as the main channel, and South-South cooperation, and calls on all parties to work together to build a community with a shared future for mankind.
China's thoughts and voices reflect the mainstream voices of the international community.
As Espinosa, president of the 73rd session of the General Assembly, said that in the current situation, â€œthe United Nations needs to promote multilateralism and safeguard the rules-based international system more than ever before.â€
IMF Managing Director Christine Lagarde said that the international community should continue to firmly uphold the multilateral trading system, adhere to international trade rules, and resolve differences through consultations.
In recent years, with the adjustment of the balance of global economic and political forces, the rise of some emerging markets and developing countries has played a greater role in major international multilateral mechanisms and provided a new impetus for the development of multilateralism.
Standing in the consideration of this dimension, China's concept of multilateralism such as building a family rather than piecing together a small circle, adhering to joint consultation and construction rather than making winner-take-all, conforms to the trend of the times, is an inevitable choice to deal with global challenges and solve the world's problems, and represents the common aspirations of most countries in the world.
There are advanced ideas and more solid actions.
China's "Belt and Road" initiative has become the largest platform for international cooperation.
China's initiative to jointly build international and regional cooperation such as the "Belt and Road", the Asian Infrastructure Investment Bank, and the "16+1 cooperation" has promoted international and regional cooperation, perfected and supplemented the existing international system and order, brought innovative vitality to multilateral cooperation, and contributed to promoting the development of the international order in a more just and reasonable direction.
As the defender of the international order and the practitioners of multilateralism, China's actions are becoming more and more powerful in the multilateral arena of the United Nations.
We will mediate international hotspots, address climate change, participate in peacekeeping operations, vigorously reduce poverty and alleviate poverty, and help other countries implement the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development.
As United Nations Secretary-General António Guterres said, China has become an important pillar of multilateralism.
As the “trust deficit” facing the world intensifies, when the trend of populism and polarization rises, it is the most urgent time for the world’s need for multilateral cooperation.
At such a historical juncture, the international community needs to join hands, turn consensus into action, resolutely safeguard multilateralism, and jointly promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind.
GUANGZHOU, Sept. 30 (Reporter Suo Youwei) Guangdong's first national standard 4K Demonstration Community was inaugurated on September 30 in the Jianzhen Garden Community of Haizhu District of Guangzhou City, and on the same day, the 4K business of Guangdong Radio and Television Network was officially launched, and the opening ceremony of the 4K ultra-high-definition channel of the Central Radio and Television Station in Guangdong Province was held simultaneously.
The day's activities were co-sponsored by Guangdong Cable Radio and Television Network Co., Ltd. and the leading group for co-construction and co-governance and shared social governance in Datang District of Haizhu District.
According to the deployment of the Guangdong Provincial Party Committee and Provincial Government, the Guangdong Radio and Television Network actively implements the 4K action plan of the new digital home, and in December 2017 released the country's first new digital home gateway terminal product that supports IPv6, the first national radio and television to support the concombination of 4-way 4K - "U point home server" (combined with the 4K box of the AVS2 standard and the voice remote control), accelerating the construction of a new digital home demonstration area marked by 4K ultra-high-definition video, the next generation of the Internet, and the application of the cable wireless fusion network.
In 2018, the Guangdong Radio and Television Network launched a series of radio and television welfare measures, and launched the â€œ3C 4K Service Monthâ€ to fully promote the â€œU point home serverâ€ in the province.
On the day of the event, the 4K business of the Guangdong radio and television network in the province was officially launched, based on the 4K application of the first 4K smart TV safe home sharing platform project was also officially unveiled and launched, the platform was jointly built by the Guangdong Cable and Haizhu District Datang area co-construction and sharing social governance leading group office, the platform project relying on the Guangdong radio and television network 4K ultra-clear U point home server, based on the cable TV network to achieve a new generation of intelligent family services, the integration of the government-related welfare service.
Chen Xiaorui, chief engineer of the Guangdong Provincial Bureau of Press, Publication, Radio and Television, said at the event that this event is the active service of radio and television network enterprises to serve the work of the government center of the party committee, the government actively uses "Internet +" to create "digital government" to serve the beneficial cooperation of the people, hoping that through cooperation and promotion, the Guangdong radio and television network can promote Haizhu District, Guangzhou and even the province to create a model of co-construction and shared social governance.
The ceremony showcased and popularized the new digital home application of 4K smart TV safe home sharing platform with 4K TV as the core.
The first phase of the "4K Smart TV Safe Home Sharing Platform" will have "Guangzhou Neighborhood", "New Guangzhou People's Home", "Smart Community" and "Smart Family" four modules on the line, focusing on exploring the construction of smart communities.
It is reported that the Guangdong radio and television network has opened 5 sets of 4K live channels, and on the National Day, it will also broadcast the 4K ultra-high-definition channel of the Central Radio and Television Station exclusively in the province.
The report is as follows: September 30, is the country's 5th Martyrs' Day.
At 10 a.m. on the same day, Xi Jinping and other party and state leaders, together with representatives from all walks of life in the capital, attended the ceremony to pay tribute to the people's heroes and remembered the heroes and martyrs.
In this regard, CCTV issued a quick comment: This is the first Martyr's Day after the implementation of China's Heroes and Martyrs Protection Law.
Five years ago, the Martyrs' Day was set on the eve of the National Day, showing the great process of the Chinese nation from suffering to glory, and we must always be vigilant: "Where do we come from, where do we go?"
General Secretary Xi Jinping profoundly pointed out that "abandoning the tradition and abandoning the fundamental is tantamount to severing their spiritual lifeline."
â€œForget that history can open up the future.â€
We advocate heroes and commemorate the martyrs, that is, we must always remember history, continue the spirit, and unite the strong positive energy of national rejuvenation.
It is pointed out that Yinglie is the backbone of the nation.
To honor the martyrs and honor the martyrs is to make Yinglie a lofty, holy and powerful eternal memory in our hearts.
According to incomplete statistics, about 20 million martyrs sacrificed bravely for national independence, people's liberation and national prosperity, and people's happiness.
Every martyr who dies for the country will be remembered, and the spirit of every devoted country will be looked upon.
The establishment of a national anniversary for them and the organization of various forms of commemorative activities is to pay tribute to them in the name of the country, deeply remember their great achievements, and learn to inherit their precious spirit of love for the motherland, loyalty to the people, selfless dedication and sacrifice.
Party committees and governments at all levels have perfected the pension preferential treatment system, continuously improved the level of pension treatment, and the party and the state practiced their respect for heroes with practical actions.
Every year, countless people visit the Martyrs' Cemetery, so that we can experience the deep feelings of the masses, and feel the rejuvenation momentum rising in the national bloodline.
Adhering to heroes, defending heroes, learning heroes, and caring heroes in the whole society.
Today, when socialism with Chinese characteristics has entered a new era, we can comfort the heroes who are sleeping underground: a powerful China is rising in the east, and the Chinese dream of the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation is becoming a reality in our hands.
Let's move forward with the strength of the spirit and strive for a great goal!
The Ministry of Finance exempts cross-border e-commerce from value-added tax
The notice pointed out that for the export of e-commerce export enterprises in the comprehensive test area without obtaining an effective purchase certificate of goods, while meeting the relevant conditions, the value-added tax and consumption tax exemption policy shall be piloted.
(1) E-commerce export enterprises are registered in the comprehensive test area and register the export date, the name of the goods, the unit of measurement, the quantity, the unit price, and the amount registered on the cross-border e-commerce online comprehensive service platform at the place of registration.
(B) the export of goods through the customs of the comprehensive test area to go through the e-commerce export declaration formalities.
(C) the export of goods does not belong to the Ministry of Finance and the State Administration of Taxation in accordance with the decision of the State Council to clearly cancel the export refund (exempted) goods.
It is reported that the above-mentioned notice has been implemented since October 1, 2018, and the specific date is based on the export date indicated in the export commodity declaration list.
The fifth "disabled voice month" to pay attention to the issue of sex education for young people with disabilities -Zhongxin.com
In recent years, the topic of sex education for young people in China has been widely discussed, but the challenge is still very difficult for children with disabilities.
Recently, a seminar on comprehensive sexual education challenges and practical strategies for people with disabilities was held in Beijing.
How sex education for children and young people with disabilities has become an important topic in this seminar.
According to the report on sexual knowledge, attitudes and behaviors of children with disabilities and young people in China released at the meeting, the proportion of children with disabilities experiencing sexual harassment and sexual abuse is higher than that of healthy children.
For children with disabilities and adolescents, it is also given more attention to “sexual protection” in society.
The purpose of this seminar is to explore the promotion of comprehensive sex education for children and adolescents with disabilities in China from the perspective of family support, school education, and institutional services, so that children with disabilities and adolescents can support children with disabilities from the source, so that they have the right to enjoy love as others.
According to experts, Chinese society's understanding of people with disabilities has always stopped at a level that is not deep enough.
Affected by factors such as traditional concepts, China's comprehensive sex education for people with disabilities, especially children and adolescents with disabilities, is not deep enough.
However, in recent years, with the support of UNESCO and people of public welfare, China's all-round development of sexual and reproductive health education practices and realization paths have been gratifyingly developed.
According to the "Report", children and young people with visual impairments, hearing impairments, intellectual disabilities and physical disabilities will be more difficult than ordinary people in acquiring sexual knowledge and understanding of intimate relationships, but in general, they have developed towards convenience and enrichment.
Organized by the Shanghai Public Welfare Foundation for Comprehensive Sex Education Challenges and Practices for Persons with Disabilities, the UNESCO Representative Office in China, the Beijing Representative Office of the International Disability Alliance (France), and the United Nations Population Fund Representative Office in China, together to discuss sexual and reproductive health education practices and realization paths for the full-cycle and comprehensive development of people with disabilities in the context of the strategy, and to promote special education and integrated education for all stakeholders, such as policymakers, educators, researchers, social service organizations, and family representatives.
BEIJING, Sept 30 (Reuters) - China’s central bank on Sunday released data showing scheduled short-term net outflows of foreign currency assets showing that as of the end of August this year, the central bank’s short positions in foreign currency-to-local currency forward and futures contracts were zero for 12 consecutive months, and there were still no long positions in that month.
According to the previous data of the central bank, as of the end of August last year, the central bank held a short position of $6.044 billion in foreign currencies for forward contracts and futures contracts, unchanged for the fourth consecutive month; the size of the short position of the SDR (Special Drawing Rights) was 4.276 billion SDR.
Since then, the central bank's foreign exchange forward short position has been zero.
At the end of March 2016, the central bank first released this data; the data shows that at the end of February 2016, the central bank's long position in foreign currency forward contracts and futures contracts was $2.438 billion, with a short position of $2.89 billion.
September data released at the end of October of the same year for the first time saw a net increase of $16.401 billion to $45.301 billion.
The central bank has previously said that the forward and futures short positions of foreign currency on the local currency mainly reflect the foreign exchange forward operation carried out by the central bank with commercial banks in order to meet the hedging needs of corporate foreign currency liabilities, and will continue to provide long-term safe-haven products according to the principle of actual needs.
On the evening of September 20 this year, on the K158 train, Qiao classmates, who were reading their juniors in Zhengzhou, took a ride to Hebi.
A man on the train bought a seatless ticket, but took her seat: "Take a picture."
Two hours by car, the conductor advised him that it would still be ineffective for an hour.
In the end, one of the male passengers in the same carriage couldn't look down and dragged the master up.
Judging from public opinion, although most of the final results are overlords who are condemned by the public, punished by the public security department, and even included in the integrity blacklist, but the public still feels that they don't "resolve": why not let the overlords be punished on the spot?
Why can't it stop its immoral or even illegal behavior on the spot, but punish it afterwards?
And for the unreasonable behavior of "overlords", how is it just a male passenger's "unsettled road" and pulls it up?
The main reason for this is that only long-distance trains are equipped with police, and short-distance trains generally do not; even if there are police, the police are more concerned about the possible scoundral reaction of the overlords and do not take compulsory removal measures.
The repeated hegemonic events have made people realize that it is necessary to let the overlords be forcibly removed or even punished on the spot in order to play a deterrent effect.
This requires that our train police should dare to take strong measures in a timely manner, and that trains that do not take the police should be deployed as soon as possible, so as to preserve and stop and crack down on illegal acts in a timely manner.
On October 1, the first day of the National Day holiday, the number of vehicles in the direction of Songpan in Mao County skyrocketed through Beichuan Qiang Autonomous County in Sichuan.
At about 13 o'clock, the Beichuan traffic police received a call for help, saying that his family had a traffic accident in Songpan, because the local medical conditions are limited, and it is urgently needed to be sent to Mianyang for treatment.
Coinciding with the implementation of one-way traffic control on the lake road in Tangjiashan, Beichuan, we would like to ask the traffic police to release 120 emergency vehicles.
After receiving the call for help, the on-duty police quickly reported the situation to the brigade, and Huang Xuemin, the captain of the brigade, simply understood the situation, and immediately arranged for the police on duty at the control point to contact the helper, and asked to make every effort to do the escort work.
"At that time, there were more than 1,000 vehicles entering the controlled section, and after contact with 120 emergency vehicles, it is expected to arrive in Beichuan at about 15:00, and we immediately arranged for deployment."
Beichuan traffic police Yuli squadron squadron Wei Wei introduced that emergency vehicles need to be bypassed from the Tangjiashanyan Lake around the lake, and the road is steep and narrow, in order to prevent vehicles that have entered this section of the road in parallel, the traffic police in advance an hour in front of the three points of the road to implement segmented control of the vehicle, and remind all the passing drivers to let drive one side of the road, for the emergency vehicle wrong.
Subsequently, the police of the drum squadron also temporarily stopped the vehicle from entering the controlled section, queuing up for the 120 emergency vehicles that were about to arrive.
At about 15 o'clock, a Sichuan U license plate ambulance drove into the territory of Beichuan, and Beichuan traffic police sent a police car to drive, escorting emergency vehicles all the way retrograde into the control section.
It is understood that there is only one car to pass around the lake road, and the police temporarily control these places in advance to ensure the smooth passage of 120 emergency vehicles.
Arriving in Luoping Township, there is a section of the road can not be wrong, so the traffic police in advance with the two committees of the village to get in touch, borrowed the village road detour, and prohibited social vehicles to enter.
"It only took 40 minutes from the Beichuan traffic police to receive 120 emergency vehicles to enter the normal road of 302 provincial roads."
According to the normal situation, the whole passage time takes 4 hours.
â€œThis arrangement has successfully obtained valuable treatment time for patients.â€
It is reported that at 17:20, critically ill patients were sent to Mianyang for treatment in time.
The confirmed death toll caused by Indonesia’s earthquake and tsunami quickly rose to 832, and authorities are concerned that the number is set to rise as rescuers struggle to provide aid to remote areas that have lost contact.
Of particular concern is Dungra, an area north of Baru with a population of 300,000, close to the epicenter of the quake.
Two other areas have lost contact since Friday.
“We have not yet received reports from the other three regions.”
Communications and electricity were still disrupted.
Nugroho said the missing included five foreigners, three of whom were French, a South Korean and a Malaysian.
The earthquake and tsunami killed 832 people.
Indonesia's Vice President Kara said the death toll could rise to thousands.
Earlier, Indonesian President Joko Widodo had surveyed the affected areas and called on the people to endure.
Nov 4 (Reuters) - Britain’s Daily Telegraph reported on Sunday that Brexit Secretary Dominic Raab had privately called for Britain’s right to “guarantee” arrangements after three months.
At a private meeting in London on Tuesday, Raab made the request to Irish Deputy Prime Minister and Minister for Foreign Affairs and Trade Simon Coveney.
Three days later, David Lidington's cabinet office minister made an "obvious contradiction" in his visit to Dublin.
Brexit Affairs said it would not comment on private meetings.
At 8:05 a.m. yesterday morning, two pickpocketing suspects were captured while pickpocketing from Yongdingmeen Station to Zhuchengkou Station by bus No. 20.
Two pickpocketing men cut the passenger's coat pocket, stole 800 yuan of the cash, and let the police, who had already squatted next to him, were caught.
This is the first pickpocketing case cracked by the Beijing police during the National Day.
At more than 5 o'clock in the morning yesterday morning, the anti-rucking investigators of the Beijing Public Security Mobile Investigation Corps arrived at their predetermined positions.
According to past experience, places where traffic is concentrated, public transport hubs, bus and subway lines, including those in Tiananmen Square, are the key areas of their work.
In the flow of people, plainclothes police calmly observed the passing crowd.
At more than 7 a.m., investigators who were squatting at the bus station found that two suspicious man's tail followed a male passenger from Yongdingmeen Station on the 20th bus.
In the car, two suspicious men, left and right, caught the male passenger in the middle, and one of them tried to cover the other.
However, they don't know that their every move has already fallen into the eyes of plainclothes policemen who have been observed.
â€œCracking thieves and scratching lootsâ€ , plainclothes police arrest people pay attention to fire, in the process of waiting for the man's hand theft, the police stared intently at the man preparing for pickpocketing, and was arrested by the investigators after they stole.
The reporter of the Beijing Morning News saw that the police seized 800 yuan in cash from the stolen suspects.
"That's the money they took from the passenger's pockets."
The police pointed to a broken coat pocket and said, "They cut it away, pickpocketed 800 yuan for a passenger who came to Beijing, and when we caught them, the money had just been put into their own pockets."
The reporter learned that in order to catch these two people, the plainclothes police followed for an hour, and finally captured it in one fell swoop at the time of the crime.
The two suspects are currently being examined by the police.
The plainclothes police told reporters that who is suspicious in the crowd, this problem is very simple for the police.
â€œIt will be found that their eyes, looks and ordinary passengers are different, in addition to staring at people's pockets and backpacks, they also like to drill into the crowd, rather than hiding from people.â€
The police also told reporters that the suspect and other cars often have no purpose, like to wander in the station, to find the object of pickpocketing will follow the car.
"These are the experience, plainclothes dry for a long time, naturally know."
In addition, the police also suggested, "the outer pocket is the most convenient, but also the most likely to be stolen."
Pay attention to your belongings during the ride to prevent them from being stolen.
Zhongxin network Tongliao September 30th (Zhang Linhu) 30th, Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region Tongliao Municipal Party Propaganda Department official WeChat released a message saying that Tongliao Kezhong Flag Committee Standing Committee, Propaganda Minister Han Bai Bila drunk driving caused 3 deaths.
On the afternoon of September 29th, 52-year-old Ke Zuozhong Flag Committee Standing Committee and Propaganda Minister Han Baiyila drove a traffic accident 1 kilometer south of Shengbei Road Racecourse in Tongliao City Development Zone, driving small ordinary buses and sanitation electric tricycles, resulting in two deaths on the spot, one person was seriously injured, and died after being rescued.
It is understood that the suspect in the accident, Hanbai Yila, has been criminally detained by the public security organs due to dangerous drunk driving, and has been involved in the investigation by the Discipline Inspection Commission of Tongliao City.
At present, the incident is under further investigation.
The reporter learned from the Traffic Management Bureau of the Ministry of Public Security of China on October 1 that on the first day of the National Day holiday, the traffic flow of roads and highways around major cities increased significantly, as of 17:00 on the same day, in addition to a small number of nodes, there are still vehicles, the traffic of highways and provincial highways in various places is generally stable and orderly, and more than 5 road traffic accidents have not been reported nationwide.
On the morning of the same day, travel peaks were generally ushered in various places, the traffic flow of roads and highways around the major cities increased significantly, and local road sections, service areas, bridges, tunnels, mutual exchanges and other nodes due to excessive traffic, road bottlenecks, scraping accidents and other reasons, there were different degrees of vehicle slow queuing phenomenon, especially the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei, Yangtze River Delta, the Pearl River Delta, Chengyu area is more prominent.
It is known that on the first day of the holidays, the national traffic police launched the holiday traffic security war service, a total of more than 190,000 police forces, more than 70,000 police vehicles, strict patrolling and control, strict control of traffic order, timely guidance of traffic, rapid handling of accidents, extensive publicity and guidance, multiple measures, to ensure that the first day of the holiday road safety unimpeded.
It is expected that on the 2nd, the traffic flow of some highways entering and exiting the city will still run at a high level, while the flow of tourist attractions will increase significantly, and traffic congestion and safety risks will increase.
British Prime Minister Theresa May on Sunday called on her party to unite in support of her Brexit plan, directly calling on critics to support it, saying they hoped for a free trade deal that was at the heart of her Brexit plan.
On September 30, 2018, in Birmingham, England, British Prime Minister Theresa May went to the Conservative Party meeting.
At the start of the Tory's exciting annual meeting, May's plan came under fire once again by two former cabinet ministers, including former Foreign Secretary Boris Johnson, who called May's plan "disarray".
But she has also received strong support from other Brexit-backed ministers who "praised May as one of the most courteous people", with international trade minister Fox and Foreign Secretary Jeremy Hunt pointing their anger at the European Union.
Theresa May’s already fragile leadership came under further pressure this month as the European Union rejected parts of the so-called “Cheks” initiative.
But Theresa May took those consultations positively, saying she was prepared to take into account the EU’s misgivings.
â€œMy message to my party is, let’s work together to find the best deal for the UK,â€ May said.
Former British Foreign Secretary Boris Johnson called May's plan "disordered" and blasted her for having no confidence in Brexit.
He and former Brexit Secretary David Davis are pushing for a Canadian-style free trade deal with the EU.
May said that the proposal would allow Northern Ireland to implement different tariff rules, which would be separated from the United Kingdom.
After 6 years, Tencent welcomes the adjustment of a major organizational structure to clarify that there will be no layoffs-Zhongxin.com
On the 30th, Tencent announced the official launch of a new round of overall strategic upgrading, and the organizational structure ushered in a new round of optimization and adjustment after six years, restructuring and integration on the basis of the original seven business groups (BG), and said that the adjustment did not involve layoffs.
Six new business groups.
After six years, two new business groups appeared.
It is understood that the new business group not only maintains the advantages and characteristics of the deep vertical, retaining the original enterprise development business group (CDG), interactive entertainment business group (IEG), technology engineering business group (TEG), WeChat business group (WXG), but also highlights the integration effect, the newly established cloud and smart industry business group (CSIG), platform and content business group (PCG).
The reporter noted that Tencent's original mobile Internet business group (MIG), the original network media business group (OMG), etc. have disappeared, especially OMG, the outside world is very well known.
Tencent said that the newly established platform and content business group (PCG, that is, Platform & Content Group), the original social networking business group (SNG), the original mobile Internet business group (MIG), the original network media business group (OMG), with social platforms, traffic platforms, digital content, core technology and other highly related and highly integrated sectors, organical separation and restructuring.
The newly established CSIG, or Cloud and Smart Industries Group, will integrate solutions in industries such as Tencent's cloud, Internet+, smart retail, education, healthcare, security and LBS to promote the digital upgrading of the industry.
Ma Huateng, chairman and CEO of Tencent, said that the second half of the Internet belongs to the industrial Internet, the first half of Tencent to provide users with high-quality services through the connection, the second half we will be on this basis, to help the industry and consumers to form a more open new connection ecology.
In response to the rumor of "redundancy": it is clear that there will be no layoffs.
After Tencent released the news of the adjustment of the organizational structure, it was reported that the adjustment would involve layoffs.
"It can be clear that this organizational structure adjustment will not involve layoffs. We will pan the various business modules as a whole, combining before optimization."
Macron promotes France's application for "long stick bread" to protect French skills
According to Reuters, European countries have successively applied for their own unique diets, following Belgian beers and pancakes in Naples, Italy, France has also recently planned to apply for long stick bread, which is included in the UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage List.
It is reported that the plan is promoted by French President Emmanuel Macron, and the French Bread and Pastry Industry Alliance expressed its support.
They pointed out that many of the long stick breads that are now sold are made of large-scale frozen dough, including materials other than flour, water, yeast and salt, and that traditional handmade bakeries are gradually declining, hoping to be included in the list to protect world-renowned French skills.
UNESCO will hold its annual meeting in Mauritius in late November to review the list of Intangible Cultural Heritage.
The sinking of an illegal migrant boat in Turkey’s Aegean Sea killed five people.
ISTANBUL, Sept. 30 (Xinhua) -- According to Turkish media reports on the 30th, an inflatable boat carrying illegal immigrants capsized in Turkey's Aegean Sea on the same day, killing at least five people.
According to reports, the inflatable boat, which was scheduled to go to an island in Greece, sank near the Enez area in the northwestern Turkish province of Edirne on the same day, and the reason for the sinking was unknown.
At present, it is not clear the number of illegal immigrants on the sunken inflatable ship.
It is estimated that there are still people trapped at sea, and related search and rescue operations are continuing.
The Aegean Sea was once the preferred route for illegal immigrants smuggled into continental Europe via Turkey.
The number of people smuggled through this route was greatly reduced following Turkey’s agreement with the European Union in March 2016.
However, since the beginning of this year, there has been a rebound in the number of smugglers on this channel.
According to the official website of the Nobel Prize, at 11:30 p.m. local time in Stockholm, Sweden, the American immunologist James Allison and the Japanese immunologist Bon Yi won the 2018 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine for the discovery of cancer therapies that inhibit negative immunomodulation.
According to Japanese media reports, the 26th Japanese person to win the Nobel Prize, and the 5th Japanese to win the Physiology or Medicine Award, the 76-year-old Benyou has made significant contributions to the treatment of new drugs for the treatment of cancer, and he learned of his award in his laboratory.
It is reported that he was born on January 27, 1942, is a Japanese doctor, medical scientist, foreign academician of the National Academy of Sciences, a member of the Japanese bachelor's college, and is currently a visiting professor at Kyoto University.
In 1992, he discovered PD-1, the T-cell inhibition receptor, and in 2013, he pioneered cancer immunotherapy, ranking first among the top ten scientific breakthroughs of Science of the year.
On September 21, 2016, he was selected as one of the "most important Japanese to the Nobel Prize".
Chinese tourists were beaten at the Thai airport: the beaters were fired from the airport's president and dismissed.
According to Thailand's headlines network reported on September 30th, recently, the video of Chinese citizens being beaten at Bangkok's Langman Airport aroused widespread attention.
At 2 p.m. local time on the 29th, Sulingwa, president of the Thai airport company Dangman Airport, explained the incident of the airport security beating tourists, and deeply apologized.
On the other hand, according to the news, Thailand's Deputy Prime Minister Ba Yi attaches great importance to this matter, has ordered the dismissal of the airport staff involved in the accident, and the general abolishment investigation of Dongman Airport.
According to the head of the airport administration, at that time, the Chinese tourist was dissatisfied with being denied entry and did not want to comply with the management and stay in the restricted area of repatriation, so there was a push and physical conflict with the security personnel.
At present, the Airport Authority has suspended the security guard.
This incident has affected the image of Thailand's tourism, and the airport deeply apologizes for the incident, and in order to make every effort to make up for the losses, the airport will express its deep apologies through the Chinese Embassy to the attacked Chinese tourists.
Finally, the airport's president said: still welcome the majority of Chinese tourists to visit Thailand, and has now provided more assistance and convenience for Chinese tourists entering Thailand, including the opening of Chinese passport-specific courtesy channels at the time of entry, including the opening of 18 Suvarnabhumi Airport, the opening of 21 Mangman Airport, and the opening of 18 from Phuket Airport.
Thailand's headlines network from the new Director-General of Thailand's National Immigration Bureau, the former deputy director of Thailand's Tourism Police Department Major General Surache, was informed that Thai Deputy Prime Minister Ba Yi attaches great importance to this matter, has ordered the dismissal of the airport staff, and the general abolition of the Langman Airport Office.
In recent years, there have been many incidents of unqualified campus plastic runways.
To this end, the Ministry of Education issued a notice, requiring that primary and secondary school synthetic material surface sports venues delivered after November 1 this year must implement the new national standard.
Compulsory national standard "Synthetic material surface sports venues in primary and secondary schools" led by the Ministry of Education, 26 scientific research institutes and testing institutions participated in the drafting, after more than two years of revision, during which more than 100 expert meetings have been organized, as well as nationwide field visits, sampling tests, collected hundreds of enterprise products on the market countless verification experiments.
Compared with the old national standard in 2005, the reporter found that the new national standard not only changed from the "national recommended standard" to the "national mandatory standard", but also added a lot of content, including thickness requirements, physical properties, aging resistance performance, inorganic filler content requirements, non-slipping granular polymer content requirements, surface layer finished products harmful substances limit, non-solid and solid raw material harmful substances limit.
In particular, it is worth mentioning that the new national standard restricts the harmful substances that may occur in the construction of the campus plastic runway, from the original 7 items to 18 items, and stipulates the number of volatile organic compounds on the completed runway in accordance with home improvement standards.
For example, the release amount of harmful substances is clearly stipulated in the "limitation of harmful substances and odor requirements in the prefabricated and prefabricated surface layer products", requiring that the total volatile organic compounds should not be higher than 5 mg/m3, formaldehyde shall not be higher than 0.4 mg/m3, carbon disulfide shall not be higher than 7 mg / cubic meter, benzene shall not be higher than 0.1 mg / cubic meter, and the odor level shall not be higher than 3.
The new national standard also provides detailed provisions on the sampling requirements, inspection rules, and judgment rules for plastic runways in primary and secondary school campuses.
In addition, the campus artificial turf has also been included in the scope of compulsory testing of the national standard for the first time.
In the near future, all localities should carry out special work deployment on the implementation of the new national standard, and submit the implementation of the new national standard to the Department of Sports Health and Arts Education of the Ministry of Education during the year.
Chengdu, September 30 (Wang Yu) on the afternoon of the 30th, the 2018 Women's Table Tennis World Cup finals staged "national table tennis civil war".
In the end, Grand Slam winner Ding Ning 4: 0 Like's teammate Zhu Yuling after four years once again ascended to the women's table tennis World Cup championship throne, this is also the 21st time that Chinese women's table tennis won the championship of the event.
Ding Ning and Zhu Yuling are teammates and friends, and both sides are very familiar with each other's techniques and tactics.
Whether it’s preparing for the game or warming up before the game, both sides follow suit.
Entering the final, the two unanimously said that they had completed the task of the competition.
However, the contest between Ding Ning and Zhu Yuling in the competition can be called the sword and shadow.
In the first game, Ding Ning, who had the dominant experience in the competition, took a 3:1 lead, and then Zhu Yuling chased the score into 3 levels with Ding Ning's mistakes.
Subsequently, Zhu Yuling's mistakes in the attack began to increase, Ding Ning seized the opportunity to take the lead by 3:9:5, and took the lead with 10:6.
Although Zhu Yuling chased for 3 points, Ding Ning still used the service to win the first game at 11:9.
In the second game, Zhu Yuling's mistakes are still high, Ding Ning with the advantage of holding 6:1 far ahead.
Zhu Yuling fell behind 2:7, relying on the rhythm to change 2 points, and then took advantage of the attack to chase the score to 8:9.
At the critical moment, Ding Ning scored 2 points and 11:8 to win another game.
In the third game, the two started with a relatively tight bite of 3:3 level.
Ding Ning then lost three points in the attack, but she then took advantage of the sharp attack to score three points to chase the score to 6 points.
Zhu Yuling scored 2 points to establish the advantage again, and took the lead in getting the game point at 10:8.
However, Ding Ning's attack was extremely fierce, and after scoring 4 points, he won the third game by 12:10.
In the fourth game, Zhu Yuling started with a 4:2 lead.
But since then, Ding Ning has shown a strong offensive state, and finally stopped Zhu Yuling after scoring 4 points.
After the suspension came back, Zhu Yuling regained some states and gradually chased the score to 8:8).
At the critical moment, Ding Ning had no soft hands and even got 2 points to get the match point.
As Zhu Yuling returned to the ball, Ding Ning 4-0 swept the opponent to win the championship.
Last month, Ding Ning won the crown at the Bulgarian Open, ending her 14-month-old championship drought, this time to Chengdu, although she said before the game that she did not set a goal for the competition, and in the semi-finals at the end of the morning, Ding Ning said that she had completed the task.
In the end, Ding Ning defeated teammate Zhu Yuling and won her third World Cup title, and she expressed satisfaction with her performance: "A championship is very important for every athlete.
I didn't think of this before the game, just to say that a game to fight, the final of their own play is still very satisfied."
Zhu Yuling won a silver medal, did not complete the goal of defending, when talking about whether the enthusiastic audience at home will cause invisible pressure on themselves, she said: "I think the whole game in terms of pressure to deal with, Ding Ning's performance today is very good, resulting in myself have not been able to find the rhythm."
To activate rural consumption, it is necessary to rely on the normalized mechanism to purify the market, guide healthy consumption demand, and enhance the sense of acquisition of farmers' consumption.
According to the data, the consumption potential of rural residents continued to be released, and the retail sales of rural consumer goods in the first half of this year increased by 10.5%, and the growth rate was 1.3 percentage points higher than that of towns and cities.
In the western county of a poor village visit, the whole village only a convenience store, into the store, some goods seem familiar, "gold dragon fish" marked as "Golden Dragon Oil", "Wangzhai" has become a "wang milk", "cottage" many goods.
Over the past few years, similar phenomena have frequently been exposed, and some rural fake and inferior goods are famous brands, with similar names, similar packaging, and falsification, which is invincible.
According to a consumer survey report released by a city in the west, the problem of rural supermarkets is serious, and 66% of users have bought fakes in township and offline supermarkets, of which food accounts for more than half.
The relevant departments to rectify the rural market, year by year shouting, why "Li ghost" is still constantly fighting?
Different from the urban market, farmers' awareness of human rights protection is relatively not strong, coupled with the remote location of many rural areas, and they are in blind spots where the regulatory force is not enough, so that fake and inferior goods have a breeding ground.
A commodity long tube, some departments to manage the price, some management production, some management of the market, functional intersection, annual anti-counterfeiting, centralized management of a gust of wind, fakes dodged through the limelight, and slowly came out, just finished the old fake, the new fake came out.
In the absence of a long-term supervision mechanism, it is difficult to purify the rural market, the illegal cost is low, and the interests are large, resulting in some unscrupulous trafficks "going to the countryside", and some rural areas have become "disambiguation markets".
From food and clothing to well-being, the majority of farmers are moving towards development-oriented consumption.
A few days ago, the Party Central Committee and the State Council issued the "Several Opinions on Improving the Mechanism for Promoting the Consumption System to further stimulate the consumption potential of Residents", which proposed to promote the upgrading of the consumption of rural residents, with the aim of making the majority of farmers "able to consume", "willing to consume" and "dare to consume", so that rural consumption is truly prosperous.
On the one hand, it is necessary to deepen the reform, eliminate the drawbacks of market supervision and multi-headed management, according to local conditions, improve food safety and product quality supervision networks, and continuously reduce the space for rural counterfeiting and counterfeiting.
On the other hand, it is necessary to strengthen law enforcement, open up the supervision of "capillaries", and never allow counterfeiting to spread in the countryside.
Severely punishing farmers is the protection of farmers, no matter how hidden the counterfeiters are hidden, they should not become the reason for the growth of fake and inferior goods, the relevant departments should clarify their responsibilities, the sinking of grass-roots regulatory forces, which links have problems, it is necessary to be held accountable, so that counterfeiters have nowhere to hide.
Strict market access clearance, the implementation of strict qualification review of production operators, close the market circulation, so that the product to the road, to clear the way, from the source, the root to find a way, so that the legal distributor peace of mind management, so that farmers can buy with confidence.
To activate rural consumption, it is necessary to guide healthy consumption demand.
With the upgrading of consumption, many farmers not only strive to eat enough, eat well, but also pursue high-quality lives such as culture and health, and can't match the rural market with "low quality" and "cheap".
This needs to promote e-commerce to the majority of rural areas to extend coverage, unblock urban and rural two-way linkage sales channels, promote the combination of offline industrial development platforms and online e-commerce trading platforms, and support the expansion of new modes of consumption to the rural market; promote qualified townships to organically combine trade logistics with leisure agriculture, rural tourism, product processing; improve the rural modern circulation network system, optimize the integration of existing facility resources, and effectively reduce rural circulation costs.
To create a clear and assured market environment for the countryside, so that the consumption of farmers will not worry, rural consumption can become more and more prosperous, so as to enhance the sense of acquisition and happiness of farmers' consumption.
From November 1st, China will reduce the most-favoured-nation tax rate for some goods, and the overall tariff level will be reduced to 7.5%.
According to the decision of the 26th executive meeting of the State Council, the Customs Tariff Commission of the State Council issued an announcement on the 30th, from November 1, 2018, to reduce the most-favoured-nation tax rate for some goods.
According to the "Announcement of the Customs Tariff Commission of the State Council to reduce import tariffs on some goods", in order to adapt to industrial upgrading, reduce the costs of enterprises and meet the needs of the masses at multi-level consumption, starting from November 1 this year, to reduce the most-favoured-nation tax rate for some industrial goods and other goods.
A total of 1,585 tax items, accounting for about 19% of the total number of China's tax items, the average tax rate from 10.5% to 7.8%, the average decline of 26%.
The tax reduction mainly involves textiles; stone, ceramics, glass products; some steel and base metal products; electromechanical equipment and parts, such as metal processing machinery, textile machinery, construction machinery, electrical equipment, electrical equipment, instrumentation, etc.; resource commodities and primary processing products, such as non-metallic minerals, inorganic chemicals, wood and paper products, jade, etc.
At the same time, with the reduction of the total tariff level, especially the import tariffs on pharmaceuticals and consumer goods, the tariff rate of import duties on imported goods has been reduced accordingly.
In order to implement the decision-making and deployment of the Party Central Committee and the State Council, China has implemented zero tariffs on the vast majority of imported drugs since May 1 this year, reduced the import tariffs on automobiles and parts and some daily consumer goods from July 1, and implemented the third step of the information technology agreement to expand the products.
The reporter learned from the Customs Tariff Commission of the State Council that since the beginning of this year, after many consecutive independent adjustments, the total level of China's tariffs will be reduced from 9.8% in the previous year to 7.5%, with an average decline of 23%.
Properly reducing tariffs is conducive to promoting the balanced development of foreign trade, promoting a higher level of opening-up, and it is also conducive to making overall use of both international and domestic resources and promoting domestic supply-side structural reform.
The relevant person in charge of the committee said that this year is the 40th anniversary of the reform and opening up, take the initiative to reduce the overall level of tariffs is the implementation of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech spirit in the Boao Forum for Asia, but also according to its own high-quality development needs to further expand opening up, take the initiative to expand imports of important measures, this action and measures show that China will unswervingly pursue a mutually beneficial and win-win opening strategy, while enhancing their own development momentum, but also let China's development better benefit the world.
On September 29, Gansu Huanxian County, "Huanxiang" agricultural products regional public brand conference was held in Nankai District of Tianjin.
Red Army millet, black beans, mountain children's pastoral song black goats, hardcover buckwheat tea, paper-cutting sheets, pure handmade slippers ... one piece of beautifully packaged agricultural products neatly placed on the booth, they have a common brand name called "rural people".
â€œCreating the â€œrenural peopleâ€ regional brand, which effectively solves the development bottleneck of â€œmultiple scattered, small and weakâ€ of agricultural products in Huanxian County, has become a powerful carrier of poverty alleviation. â€œOn the 29th, Gansu Huanxing County hosted the â€�œTownsideâ€ regional public brand conference for agricultural products held in Nankai District of Tianjin.
Huanxian County is located at the junction of the three provinces and regions of Shaan Ganning, as "advanced counties of national food production", "hometown of small grains in China", "hometown of Chinese shadow", with a long history and rich resources.
Lamb meat, yellow rice wine, buckwheat noodles, swallow noodles soft and other local snacks are often remembered by tourists in their hometowns.
With the continuous improvement of the level of urbanization in China and the rapid increase of the urban population, a large number of rural young people have left their hometowns to start urban life.
Yang Qiaojia, an expert in China's agricultural brand research, said: "Now urban life is fast and stressful, and more and more people are beginning to miss the rural life as a child, but the most beautiful memory is the countryside, and the brand design is named after the nostalgia and nostalgia of the people who drift around the county outside."
The climatic conditions are special, the sunshine time is long, the temperature difference between day and night is large, and the planting conditions of the characteristics of small miscellaneous grains are unique.
There are more than 20 kinds of small grains, which is the hometown of small grains in China, and the output ranks first in Gansu, and the quality is in the forefront of the country.
Wang Xiaoli is in Tianjin to go to school in Huanxian girls, this time as a volunteer to participate in the promotion meeting, she said: "the hometown of the most relatives, the taste of the hometown is the most beautiful, 'rural people' brand hooked up too much of our nostalgia, memories, not to forget is the food there, I hope the 'rural people' brand more and more far away, more and more."
Dr. Tan Bin, a researcher at the Scientific Research Institute of the National Food and Material Reserve Bureau, said that through the detection of more than 900 sets of index data, the detection data of various agricultural products such as buckwheat, buckwheat and black beans in Huan County are outstanding, and the content of many physiologically active substances in miscellaneous grains is higher than the standard data.
Chai Chun, secretary of the Huanxian County Party Committee, said that through the release of the brand of "rural people", it can further improve the quality, standardization and large-scale innovation and development level of high-quality agricultural products in Huanxian County, which is conducive to shaping the overall image of agricultural products in Huanxian County, and rapidly improving visibility, competitiveness and added value.
Canada's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 0.2% in July from the previous month, higher than expected, raising expectations that the Bank of Canada will raise interest rates next month.
If it does, it will be the central bank’s fifth rate hike in more than a year.
Analysts interviewed by Reuters had forecast growth of 0.1 percent.
Statistics Canada said on Friday that 12 of the 20 industries had achieved growth.
This data is noteworthy because the central bank predicted earlier this month that temporary factors could drag down third-quarter GDP data.
Bank of Canada Governor Poloz on Thursday promised that the central bank will continue to raise interest rates gradually, and will pay close attention to economic data.
The Bank of Canada’s next interest rate announcement will take place on October 24.
Due to Canada’s strengthening economy and near-record lows in unemployment, the Bank of Canada has raised interest rates four times since July 2017.
Stephen Brown, a senior Canadian economist at Capital Economics, said that the country's economy's third-quarter GDP growth rate is expected to reach about 2% year-on-year.
"This will be higher than the Bank of Canada's expectation of 1.5 per cent and will therefore be another reason to expect the Bank of Canada to raise interest rates next month," he said in a report.
Overnight index swaps show that the market's estimate of the Bank of Canada's chance of raising interest rates in October increased from 76.46% to 78.27%.
The first joint inspection of the Han River into the sea for the first time of the 65th
South Korea's Ministry of National Defense confirmed on the 5th that on the same day, the ROK launched a joint inspection of the Han River and the Linjin River into the sea.
This initiative is an early preparation to ensure the freedom of navigation of civilian ships on both sides.
According to the notification provided to the media by the Ministry of National Defense on the same day, this is the first time that the two sides have conducted a joint inspection of the Han River into the sea since the signing of the Korean War Armistice Agreement in 1953.
In September this year, the DPRK signed a military agreement and agreed that it will jointly visit waters such as the entrance of the Han River into the sea since November to ensure environmental protection, development and tourism of the waters in the future.
In October, the two Koreas planned a joint inspection of the waters at a general-level meeting.
On November 5th, the joint inspection of inter-Korean waters was officially launched.
The joint mission consists of 20 members, including the inter-Korean military and experts.
According to South Korea's Ministry of National Defense, during this investigation, personnel from both sides did not carry weapons and banned the use of words and deeds to stimulate each other.
"Because there is no military demarcation line near the mouth of the sea, the area used to be an unexpectedly high area, but through joint inspection, it will become a new peaceful area in the future."
The total length of the joint inter-Korean inspection is about 70 kilometers, with a total area of about 280 square kilometers.
According to the South Korean Ministry of National Defense, the ROK side will send six inspection ships to detect the depth of the seawater and provide basic information for the safe navigation of the waters; after the completion of the investigation, it will provide a navigation map for the traffic of civilian ships.
In October 2007, the two Koreas held a summit meeting in Pyongyang to reach an agreement on the joint use of the Han River and the Linjin River to enter the sea, but the follow-up talks were stranded due to tensions on the Korean Peninsula.
According to the military agreement signed by the two Koreas in September, ships from both sides in the future need to inform each other in advance before sailing in common waters.
According to the website of the Chinese Embassy in Mongolia on the 4th, recently, Chinese citizens Guo Yuqin and Mao Runxin lost contact during tourism in Mongolia.
It is understood that the two are members of the blue sky rescue team, on October 19th, the two contacted domestic relatives and friends, saying that they were about to venture into the mountains near Lake Kusugur, and shared their location through WeChat, after which they lost contact and were suspected to have gone to the no-man's land.
The Chinese Embassy in Mongolia has always attached great importance to protecting the legitimate rights and safety of Chinese citizens in Mongolia, and attaches great importance to consular protection and assistance.
After learning that the above two tourists had lost contact, the embassy immediately launched an emergency plan, striving to seize the golden rescue time and fully carry out its work.
The embassy maintained close communication with the families of the parties, assisted the families to immediately report the case to the Mongolian police, and provided the families with a list of interpreters for selection.
At the first time, the embassy met with the heads of the Ministry of External Relations of Mongolia, the General Directorate of Police and the General Administration of Emergencies to inform them of the relevant situation, and asked the Mongolian side to carry out search and rescue as soon as possible, and maintain close communication with the Mongolian side throughout the search and rescue process to ensure that the latest progress should be kept in time.
At the same time, the Embassy assisted the family in issuing notices to find people in Mongolia, and widely mobilized the active participation of Mongolian overseas Chinese and Chinese-funded enterprises, provided effective clues, and provided relevant assistance to a number of blue sky rescue team members who went to Mongolia to assist in rescue.
Under the strong impetus of the embassy, the Mongolian side sent a rescue team for the first time, and promised to eliminate search and rescue costs.
The General Directorate of Police of Mongolia and the Directorate-General for Emergencies directed the police and emergency services in Kusugur province to make full efforts in search and rescue.
Because Lake Kusugur is located in the northern part of Mongolia and the border with Russia, it is remote and sparse, traffic and communication are extremely inconvenient, and at present, Mongolia has entered a severe winter, the temperature is as low as minus 20 degrees, the local police and emergency departments have overcome great difficulties, mobilized almost all the police forces, and mobilized local herdsmen to carry out carpet search and rescue in a wide range around their missing locations.
At the same time, in view of the special situation of pastoral areas, Mongfang has been publishing notices through the radio cycle for many days.
The relevant staff of the domestic blue sky rescue team have also come to Mongolia to actively participate in the rescue with the Mongolian side.
The safety of the two missing people has always touched our hearts.
So far, more than 10 days have lost contact, and the embassy has received some clues, but the two have not yet been found, and the search and rescue operation is still tense.
The embassy will always continue to pay attention to this matter in accordance with the principle of "people-oriented", promote Mongolia's efforts to search and rescue, and provide maximum assistance to the families of the parties concerned.
The Embassy calls on compatriots and enterprises in Mongolia, if they know the relevant clues, please contact the Chinese Embassy in Mongolia for the first time.
